(59688, 1509, 139, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo.  I would have enjoyed it much more had you not given it away with the title.</td>', 'This is a really great photo.  I would have enjoyed it much more had you not given it away with the title.', '2002-05-14 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
