(59691, 1509, 885, '<td valign="top">Oh awesome.  This is the best reflection photo I''ve seen so far.  Really strong in black and white.</td>', 'Oh awesome.  This is the best reflection photo I''ve seen so far.  Really strong in black and white.', '2002-05-14 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59692, 1509, 1323, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture.  I hope to read about this in the how''d they do that section.</td>', 'Amazing picture.  I hope to read about this in the how''d they do that section.', '2002-05-14 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59693, 1509, 387, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally comment on pics that I hold in high regard because most pics this good get repetitive remarks of "Great!" and "Wonderful!" In this case it really is. The use of lines and curves were wonderful. Contrast is great. it gives the feeling of snow in a snow globe. Very thought provoking.</td>', 'I don''t normally comment on pics that I hold in high regard because most pics this good get repetitive remarks of "Great!" and "Wonderful!" In this case it really is. The use of lines and curves were wonderful. Contrast is great. it gives the feeling of snow in a snow globe. Very thought provoking.', '2002-05-14 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59694, 1509, 675, '<td valign="top">okay this picture is amazing, absolutely stunning, i want to know how it was done</td>', 'okay this picture is amazing, absolutely stunning, i want to know how it was done', '2002-05-14 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59695, 1509, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I might have ignored those "ugly blotches" at the top had I not read your title...and I like the B+W look.</td>', 'Hmm...I might have ignored those "ugly blotches" at the top had I not read your title...and I like the B+W look.', '2002-05-14 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
