(59730, 1510, 1078, '<td valign="top">The angles on the barn in this one bother me.  I''m not sure why.  Perhaps just because it''s upside down.  Maybe a different location with a tighter shot of the bike?  Other than that, the colors seems a tiny bit dark.  Easy to adjust in your editing program, I''m sure.</td>', 'The angles on the barn in this one bother me.  I''m not sure why.  Perhaps just because it''s upside down.  Maybe a different location with a tighter shot of the bike?  Other than that, the colors seems a tiny bit dark.  Easy to adjust in your editing program, I''m sure.', '2002-05-15 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59731, 1510, 1, '<td valign="top">Bland subject: just a snapshot turned upside down.</td>', 'Bland subject: just a snapshot turned upside down.', '2002-05-19 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59732, 1512, 1344, '<td valign="top">Have no clue what it is but it''s lookin a bit lewd..  Nothing is saying "upside down" to me either..</td>', 'Have no clue what it is but it''s lookin a bit lewd..  Nothing is saying "upside down" to me either..', '2002-05-13 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59733, 1512, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo because it''s such a puzzle. Any closely cropped part of the human body with hair *always* leads people to jump to rude conclusions :). However, it''s hard to tell whether or not this is rude, or whether or not it''s upside down, so I expect a few disqualification calls.... bah. It''s a cool idea. Shame about the low resolution.</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo because it''s such a puzzle. Any closely cropped part of the human body with hair *always* leads people to jump to rude conclusions :). However, it''s hard to tell whether or not this is rude, or whether or not it''s upside down, so I expect a few disqualification calls.... bah. It''s a cool idea. Shame about the low resolution.', '2002-05-13 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
