(59823, 1520, 446, '<td valign="top">Absolutely excellent exposure.  A little noisy, but extremely well done nonetheless.  One of the best I see for this week.</td>', 'Absolutely excellent exposure.  A little noisy, but extremely well done nonetheless.  One of the best I see for this week.', '2002-05-13 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59824, 1520, 1528, '<td valign="top">nice  idea<br/>works for me<br/>angles, colors.....<br/>the light direction and sort of weak shadows would be nice if they were stronger in my opinion.<br/>good job.</td>', 'nice  ideaworks for meangles, colors.....the light direction and sort of weak shadows would be nice if they were stronger in my opinion.good job.', '2002-05-14 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59825, 1520, 387, '<td valign="top">This is a classic still life set-up with great composition. The upset bowl of apples is obviously the subject of the photo. The redness of the apples lends to the overall classic feel. The lighting might me a little harsh on the shiny surfaces. The walls in the background frame the table nicely, but lining up the corner of the table with the corner of the walls might have given the photo a more resolved look. Nice job in preparing the area, it''s free of distractions. General feeling of the photo is a warm one, reminds me of paintings that might hang in your grandparents house.</td>', 'This is a classic still life set-up with great composition. The upset bowl of apples is obviously the subject of the photo. The redness of the apples lends to the overall classic feel. The lighting might me a little harsh on the shiny surfaces. The walls in the background frame the table nicely, but lining up the corner of the table with the corner of the walls might have given the photo a more resolved look. Nice job in preparing the area, it''s free of distractions. General feeling of the photo is a warm one, reminds me of paintings that might hang in your grandparents house.', '2002-05-14 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59826, 1520, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  The apples "rolling out" helps create "interest", Nice and Simple!  Photo 10 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 9 total 9</td>', 'Good shot!  The apples "rolling out" helps create "interest", Nice and Simple!  Photo 10 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 9 total 9', '2002-05-14 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59827, 1520, 1529, '<td valign="top">Overall beautiful. Some color in the background would balance the composition.</td>', 'Overall beautiful. Some color in the background would balance the composition.', '2002-05-14 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59828, 1520, 1570, '<td valign="top">kind of pretty,but not very interesting...</td>', 'kind of pretty,but not very interesting...', '2002-05-15 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59829, 1520, 933, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors inthis one.   The background is a bit grainy, especially on the right - are you able to shoot at a higher ISO?  The only other distracting element is the crak in the wall behind the table.  Maybe if you moved the table and had some flat surface behind the whole scene?  Anyway, very nice work!</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors inthis one.   The background is a bit grainy, especially on the right - are you able to shoot at a higher ISO?  The only other distracting element is the crak in the wall behind the table.  Maybe if you moved the table and had some flat surface behind the whole scene?  Anyway, very nice work!', '2002-05-15 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59830, 1520, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  good choice of subject</td>', 'nice photo.  good choice of subject', '2002-05-15 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59831, 1520, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The lighting is very effective, causeing nice highlights on the apples and lovely long, soft shadows. It''s soft enough to bring out all the subtle shapes on the bowl. The arrangement is at once very static, but also suggests it just fell over so there''s a dynamic element to it as well. Lastly, the tiles and muted colours in the background add a lot to bringing out the colours and roundness of the apples. Lots to look at in a deceptively simple photo :). 10</td>', 'I love this photo. The lighting is very effective, causeing nice highlights on the apples and lovely long, soft shadows. It''s soft enough to bring out all the subtle shapes on the bowl. The arrangement is at once very static, but also suggests it just fell over so there''s a dynamic element to it as well. Lastly, the tiles and muted colours in the background add a lot to bringing out the colours and roundness of the apples. Lots to look at in a deceptively simple photo :). 10', '2002-05-16 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59832, 1520, 107, '<td valign="top">The colours really stand out in this picture.. the apples look nice and crisp, like you could just pick one up and eat it.  job well done.</td>', 'The colours really stand out in this picture.. the apples look nice and crisp, like you could just pick one up and eat it.  job well done.', '2002-05-16 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59833, 1520, 259, '<td valign="top">looks a tad bit over sharpened on my monitor, otherwise, a nice photo</td>', 'looks a tad bit over sharpened on my monitor, otherwise, a nice photo', '2002-05-16 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59834, 1520, 1078, '<td valign="top">Dig the shot, but wish it was lit on the opposite side -- that way the apples wouldn''t be in the shadow of the fruit bowl.  Lighting is also causing there to be kind of a lot of noise in the shot and with all those flat white surfaces, it''s really noticeable.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Dig the shot, but wish it was lit on the opposite side -- that way the apples wouldn''t be in the shadow of the fruit bowl.  Lighting is also causing there to be kind of a lot of noise in the shot and with all those flat white surfaces, it''s really noticeable.  Nicely composed.', '2002-05-17 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59835, 1520, 1209, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate it when this happens?!  Nicely set up and shot, on of my favorites!</td>', 'Don''t you hate it when this happens?!  Nicely set up and shot, on of my favorites!', '2002-05-17 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59836, 1520, 1070, '<td valign="top">not a bad shot... the lighting could have been a bit better to give the photo more umph !</td>', 'not a bad shot... the lighting could have been a bit better to give the photo more umph !', '2002-05-17 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59837, 1520, 875, '<td valign="top">The idea and the colors work well.  I might have tried a little more dramatic lighting.  If the light on the right was moved down, the apple''s shadows would be even longer.</td>', 'The idea and the colors work well.  I might have tried a little more dramatic lighting.  If the light on the right was moved down, the apple''s shadows would be even longer.', '2002-05-17 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59838, 1520, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and composition of this picture.  The background (wall) and foreground (lower right table) seems a little grainy to me, but it could be on my end.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and composition of this picture.  The background (wall) and foreground (lower right table) seems a little grainy to me, but it could be on my end.  Nice shot.', '2002-05-18 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59839, 1520, 1707, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and great control over shadows.  An unique perpective.  -NBT</td>', 'Good lighting and great control over shadows.  An unique perpective.  -NBT', '2002-05-19 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59840, 1522, 54, '<td valign="top">So many pennies, so much bad luck. ;)</td>', 'So many pennies, so much bad luck. ;)', '2002-05-13 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59841, 1522, 1024, '<td valign="top">I do not see how this meets the chellenge of upside down, but its a very striking photograph and I have given it high marks for that.</td>', 'I do not see how this meets the chellenge of upside down, but its a very striking photograph and I have given it high marks for that.', '2002-05-13 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(59842, 1522, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well executed.</td>', 'Nice idea, well executed.', '2002-05-13 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59843, 1522, 47, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2002-05-13 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59844, 1522, 1263, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but I am not sure if tails is upside down but I am still giving you a 7 because I like the shot.</td>', 'I like the shot but I am not sure if tails is upside down but I am still giving you a 7 because I like the shot.', '2002-05-13 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59845, 1522, 156, '<td valign="top">you''ve got more''n me!  nicely done</td>', 'you''ve got more''n me!  nicely done', '2002-05-13 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59846, 1522, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute title. I like your idea very much.<br/>Color seems a bit off and I admit it may be my monitor.<br/>Still good work and on target.<br/></td>', 'Cute title. I like your idea very much.Color seems a bit off and I admit it may be my monitor.Still good work and on target.', '2002-05-13 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59847, 1522, 92, '<td valign="top">I really like this. This is a 10 in my book:)</td>', 'I really like this. This is a 10 in my book:)', '2002-05-13 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59848, 1522, 772, '<td valign="top">There are a few coins here that are upside down :)  Keep on saving :)</td>', 'There are a few coins here that are upside down :)  Keep on saving :)', '2002-05-13 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59849, 1522, 1457, '<td valign="top">wow! suck to be you! I hope you taught your kids how to save money.</td>', 'wow! suck to be you! I hope you taught your kids how to save money.', '2002-05-13 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59850, 1522, 1599, '<td valign="top">pennies from heven, should have been this title</td>', 'pennies from heven, should have been this title', '2002-05-13 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59851, 1522, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d have rotated a couple more pennies so there was only one coin right-side up...</td>', 'I''d have rotated a couple more pennies so there was only one coin right-side up...', '2002-05-14 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59852, 1522, 472, '<td valign="top">i''m so sorry you''re so poor but that''s a really cool picture.</td>', 'i''m so sorry you''re so poor but that''s a really cool picture.', '2002-05-14 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59853, 1522, 1528, '<td valign="top">I like!<br/>Could''ve benefitted only from being a lil sharper focus maybe.<br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'I like!Could''ve benefitted only from being a lil sharper focus maybe.Nice shot.', '2002-05-14 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59854, 1522, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, not certain how it pertains to upsidedown.  Good macro shot.  Photo 8 Creative 7 Upsidedown 6 total 7</td>', 'Interesting shot, not certain how it pertains to upsidedown.  Good macro shot.  Photo 8 Creative 7 Upsidedown 6 total 7', '2002-05-14 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59855, 1522, 1636, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation.</td>', 'interesting interpretation.', '2002-05-15 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59856, 1522, 878, '<td valign="top">Tails vs upside down tough call on that.  I can relate on the subject :)</td>', 'Tails vs upside down tough call on that.  I can relate on the subject :)', '2002-05-15 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59857, 1522, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and I like the monochromatic coppery color.  I guess it''s the "tails" side, but I wonder if people don''t get the upside-down-ness of it.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and I like the monochromatic coppery color.  I guess it''s the "tails" side, but I wonder if people don''t get the upside-down-ness of it.', '2002-05-16 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59858, 1522, 875, '<td valign="top">It looks like my life savings, too.  It''s a clever idea with nice detail.</td>', 'It looks like my life savings, too.  It''s a clever idea with nice detail.', '2002-05-17 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59859, 1522, 1446, '<td valign="top">Composition- No paticular center of interest. Makes you take it all in at once. Background- Use of layers for background interesting.  Technical- Very good, perfect exposure and focus. You obviously took a lot of care in placement of these pennies.  Overall Impression- Nothing here to draw you into this picture, while its technically very good, the subject is lacking something, meets the challenge well. I like the way you not only placed the pennies tails up, but they are all facing different directions, so no matter which way you turn this some of them are upside down.</td>', 'Composition- No paticular center of interest. Makes you take it all in at once. Background- Use of layers for background interesting.  Technical- Very good, perfect exposure and focus. You obviously took a lot of care in placement of these pennies.  Overall Impression- Nothing here to draw you into this picture, while its technically very good, the subject is lacking something, meets the challenge well. I like the way you not only placed the pennies tails up, but they are all facing different directions, so no matter which way you turn this some of them are upside down.', '2002-05-17 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59860, 1522, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice shot -- I think this would be really cool printed HUGE.  I recently shot some coins myself for a project, and I know that the lighting can be a pain.  (I wonder if it might be easier to shoot "older" pennies that aren''t so shiny...anyway...)  Those highlights are really hot, I wonder if it''s possible to tone them down a bit.  Hard call to make though, because they are important for helping define edges, so I don''t know.</td>', 'Nice shot -- I think this would be really cool printed HUGE.  I recently shot some coins myself for a project, and I know that the lighting can be a pain.  (I wonder if it might be easier to shoot "older" pennies that aren''t so shiny...anyway...)  Those highlights are really hot, I wonder if it''s possible to tone them down a bit.  Hard call to make though, because they are important for helping define edges, so I don''t know.', '2002-05-17 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59861, 1522, 543, '<td valign="top">I hear that!  Nice macro, although I think more diffused light might have brought out the detail without the harshness the sidelighting produced.  Funny that the one penny on the UR hotspot is right side up.</td>', 'I hear that!  Nice macro, although I think more diffused light might have brought out the detail without the harshness the sidelighting produced.  Funny that the one penny on the UR hotspot is right side up.', '2002-05-18 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59862, 1522, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the subject(s) fills the frame and spills out of it.</td>', 'I like the way the subject(s) fills the frame and spills out of it.', '2002-05-18 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59863, 1524, 772, '<td valign="top">i think ollie could stand a bit more light... good shot!</td>', 'i think ollie could stand a bit more light... good shot!', '2002-05-13 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59864, 1524, 327, '<td valign="top">Ollie is pretty cute, even upside down.</td>', 'Ollie is pretty cute, even upside down.', '2002-05-13 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59865, 1524, 1599, '<td valign="top">ollie ollie ox in free</td>', 'ollie ollie ox in free', '2002-05-13 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59866, 1524, 472, '<td valign="top">poor ollie fell down ... i think you should have had a much dimmer light but more of it than there is now on ollie''s camera-right side.</td>', 'poor ollie fell down ... i think you should have had a much dimmer light but more of it than there is now on ollie''s camera-right side.', '2002-05-13 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59867, 1524, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is just so incredibly dramatic and emotive, with that lighting and the camera angle on the little guy. It''s very funny :)</td>', 'This photo is just so incredibly dramatic and emotive, with that lighting and the camera angle on the little guy. It''s very funny :)', '2002-05-13 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59868, 1524, 1528, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadows.</td>', 'Nice use of shadows.', '2002-05-14 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59869, 1524, 1005, '<td valign="top">Portrait :  Bear  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'Portrait :  Bear  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59870, 1524, 387, '<td valign="top">nice still life. the only recommendation I might make is to try to get the catchlight in both eyes.</td>', 'nice still life. the only recommendation I might make is to try to get the catchlight in both eyes.', '2002-05-14 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59871, 1524, 675, '<td valign="top">not really that wonderful, my glow worm beats that thing any day.  nice picture, perhaps next time get rid of whatever it is in the top left corner of the screen<br/></td>', 'not really that wonderful, my glow worm beats that thing any day.  nice picture, perhaps next time get rid of whatever it is in the top left corner of the screen', '2002-05-14 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59872, 1524, 1360, '<td valign="top">This picture gets "awwwwwww!" points.</td>', 'This picture gets "awwwwwww!" points.', '2002-05-15 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59873, 1524, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice but a little too dark for my tast.</td>', 'Nice but a little too dark for my tast.', '2002-05-16 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59874, 1524, 1512, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!</td>', 'Excellent photo!', '2002-05-16 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59875, 1524, 2, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!!  I really like this shot.  My only complaint is the little bit of noise on the pillows -- you should try running despeckle in photoshop to remove them.</td>', 'Very nice picture!!  I really like this shot.  My only complaint is the little bit of noise on the pillows -- you should try running despeckle in photoshop to remove them.', '2002-05-19 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59876, 1524, 1, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the left is really nice and soft, but the darkness on the right doesn''t fit into the image.</td>', 'The lighting on the left is really nice and soft, but the darkness on the right doesn''t fit into the image.', '2002-05-19 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59877, 1525, 1024, '<td valign="top">wow, no wonder this took so many tries.  You get extra points for tenacity.</td>', 'wow, no wonder this took so many tries.  You get extra points for tenacity.', '2002-05-13 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59878, 1525, 47, '<td valign="top">uhm.. krazy glue ? you should have used a bit more light i think.</td>', 'uhm.. krazy glue ? you should have used a bit more light i think.', '2002-05-13 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59879, 1525, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat concept.  How did you manage to get this coin stack to stay steady for you?  This photo needs a little bump on the contrast.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a neat concept.  How did you manage to get this coin stack to stay steady for you?  This photo needs a little bump on the contrast.  Good job!', '2002-05-13 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59880, 1525, 327, '<td valign="top">Either direction.....you got balance!! Well done and neat effect.<br/></td>', 'Either direction.....you got balance!! Well done and neat effect.', '2002-05-13 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59881, 1525, 1599, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-05-13 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59882, 1525, 963, '<td valign="top">Without glue that would have taken effort!</td>', 'Without glue that would have taken effort!', '2002-05-13 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59883, 1525, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the colors are a bit lacking, and there is very little detail on the coins, but this was probably taken with a 1 or sub-megapixel camera, for which this can''t be faulted.  Still, I think better lighting may have helped.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the colors are a bit lacking, and there is very little detail on the coins, but this was probably taken with a 1 or sub-megapixel camera, for which this can''t be faulted.  Still, I think better lighting may have helped.', '2002-05-13 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59884, 1525, 1143, '<td valign="top">Kudos for the balancing act. Cool idea, but the execution isn''t very good. The table and white wall detract.</td>', 'Kudos for the balancing act. Cool idea, but the execution isn''t very good. The table and white wall detract.', '2002-05-13 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59885, 1525, 1605, '<td valign="top">Not brilliant.</td>', 'Not brilliant.', '2002-05-14 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59886, 1525, 1070, '<td valign="top">i really just don''t see the point of this photo<br/>the backdrop looks awful and ruins the small amount that the photo had to offer</td>', 'i really just don''t see the point of this photothe backdrop looks awful and ruins the small amount that the photo had to offer', '2002-05-14 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59887, 1525, 1528, '<td valign="top">Amazing feat.<br/>I imagine the blurriness could''nt be avoided trying to catch such a shot.</td>', 'Amazing feat.I imagine the blurriness could''nt be avoided trying to catch such a shot.', '2002-05-14 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59888, 1525, 472, '<td valign="top">that''s hilarious.  too bad the shot is so tonally flat.  needs a lot more contrast and sharpening.</td>', 'that''s hilarious.  too bad the shot is so tonally flat.  needs a lot more contrast and sharpening.', '2002-05-14 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59889, 1525, 656, '<td valign="top">strong glue used! :)  ''horizon'' could do with being flat rather than slightly tilted.</td>', 'strong glue used! :)  ''horizon'' could do with being flat rather than slightly tilted.', '2002-05-14 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59890, 1525, 1005, '<td valign="top">High grade for attempts made (3,493,394), save time/effort and cheat.  Tape, wire and monofiliment are our friends.  Soft focus.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'High grade for attempts made (3,493,394), save time/effort and cheat.  Tape, wire and monofiliment are our friends.  Soft focus.Photo 8 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59891, 1525, 1529, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feat of balance. Lame with respect to the topic.</td>', 'Wonderful feat of balance. Lame with respect to the topic.', '2002-05-14 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59892, 1525, 1031, '<td valign="top">Six or seven  drops of SuperGlue might have saved you a couple of million attempts...looks like it was worth the trouble though.</td>', 'Six or seven  drops of SuperGlue might have saved you a couple of million attempts...looks like it was worth the trouble though.', '2002-05-15 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59893, 1525, 1636, '<td valign="top">Pretty Cool</td>', 'Pretty Cool', '2002-05-15 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59894, 1525, 1468, '<td valign="top">Oh My God..</td>', 'Oh My God..', '2002-05-15 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59895, 1525, 1191, '<td valign="top">Very clever, but what has it got to do with being upside down??</td>', 'Very clever, but what has it got to do with being upside down??', '2002-05-15 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59896, 1525, 885, '<td valign="top">Impressive, but it would have been REALLY impressive if you''d paid more careful attention to lighting and post-processing.</td>', 'Impressive, but it would have been REALLY impressive if you''d paid more careful attention to lighting and post-processing.', '2002-05-16 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59897, 1525, 1336, '<td valign="top">i admire your patience, but wish the picture was clearer.</td>', 'i admire your patience, but wish the picture was clearer.', '2002-05-16 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59898, 1525, 675, '<td valign="top">that must have either been really hard or really easy.  my only problems here are the tilted horizon and the poor lighting</td>', 'that must have either been really hard or really easy.  my only problems here are the tilted horizon and the poor lighting', '2002-05-17 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59899, 1525, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really clever idea -- would have been "mundane" right side up (although still tricky) -- but upside down adds a great deal to it.  I would have cropped it/shot it so the bird hung perfectly straight down the column of coins instead of just to the left.  The focus seems a little soft on the bird and coins -- but it also looks like maybe your camera isn''t quite so high end, so maybe that''s the problem there.  A light shining on the front of the coins to bring out detail would be nice.  The colors of the picture seem to be a little green -- but that''s assuming the wall at the back is white.  Finally, a different background besides the wall and table would bring this up another notch and change it from isn''t this cool what I balanced, to isn''t this a great shot...</td>', 'I think this is a really clever idea -- would have been "mundane" right side up (although still tricky) -- but upside down adds a great deal to it.  I would have cropped it/shot it so the bird hung perfectly straight down the column of coins instead of just to the left.  The focus seems a little soft on the bird and coins -- but it also looks like maybe your camera isn''t quite so high end, so maybe that''s the problem there.  A light shining on the front of the coins to bring out detail would be nice.  The colors of the picture seem to be a little green -- but that''s assuming the wall at the back is white.  Finally, a different background besides the wall and table would bring this up another notch and change it from isn''t this cool what I balanced, to isn''t this a great shot...', '2002-05-17 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59900, 1525, 1042, '<td valign="top">cool! crazy glue?? or just great balance?</td>', 'cool! crazy glue?? or just great balance?', '2002-05-18 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59901, 1525, 811, '<td valign="top">Ya know,  a different background/foreground (whichever it is) would have done wonders for this picture.  Maybe solid black, or white, or black and white.  I don''t know.  Currently, it is just a little drab.  The trick is nice.  I''ve seen those birds before, what how did you do that with the coins?  That''s neat.</td>', 'Ya know,  a different background/foreground (whichever it is) would have done wonders for this picture.  Maybe solid black, or white, or black and white.  I don''t know.  Currently, it is just a little drab.  The trick is nice.  I''ve seen those birds before, what how did you do that with the coins?  That''s neat.', '2002-05-18 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
