(59928, 1526, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection -- the trees are virtually perfect.  I find myself wishing that the branch and rocks and dead leaves weren''t in the picture, but short of you trudging into the water and taking them out, I don''t know what you could do about it.  Along those lines, I''d also love to see this same shot taken on a slightly less cloudy day to get some more of that blue in the reflection -- the cloudy portions let me see through the water just a bit too easily.  But, since you can''t control the weather...  :-)</td>', 'Nice reflection -- the trees are virtually perfect.  I find myself wishing that the branch and rocks and dead leaves weren''t in the picture, but short of you trudging into the water and taking them out, I don''t know what you could do about it.  Along those lines, I''d also love to see this same shot taken on a slightly less cloudy day to get some more of that blue in the reflection -- the cloudy portions let me see through the water just a bit too easily.  But, since you can''t control the weather...  :-)', '2002-05-19 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59929, 1526, 2, '<td valign="top">This shot is great.  You''ve really used upside-down to destroy my sense of ''usual''.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This shot is great.  You''ve really used upside-down to destroy my sense of ''usual''.  Nicely done.', '2002-05-19 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
