(59952, 1527, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m very curious to find out what YOUR version of the "story" is behind the shot and title.  I know what I''ve come up with, but I''ll be interested to see if they match.  Technically, I think this is a little over-exposed.  I think I would have darkened things up a little bit -- make the whites not quite so washed out and the blacks a little darker.  HOWEVER, with my version of the story, even having it a little messed up exposure-wise works, so....</td>', 'I''m very curious to find out what YOUR version of the "story" is behind the shot and title.  I know what I''ve come up with, but I''ll be interested to see if they match.  Technically, I think this is a little over-exposed.  I think I would have darkened things up a little bit -- make the whites not quite so washed out and the blacks a little darker.  HOWEVER, with my version of the story, even having it a little messed up exposure-wise works, so....', '2002-05-17 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59953, 1527, 1066, '<td valign="top">This photo started out in the middle of the pack with a 5 or 6 becasue it was a bit washed out.<br/><br/>As the week wore on I moved the photo up and up.<br/><br/>Originality, well photographed (needs a touch more contrast to the dop) moved this photo into my top 10.  Nice job!</td>', 'This photo started out in the middle of the pack with a 5 or 6 becasue it was a bit washed out.As the week wore on I moved the photo up and up.Originality, well photographed (needs a touch more contrast to the dop) moved this photo into my top 10.  Nice job!', '2002-05-17 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59954, 1527, 749, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus on any specific object really adds to this... a photo that seems to tell a story all by itself - very impressive</td>', 'The lack of focus on any specific object really adds to this... a photo that seems to tell a story all by itself - very impressive', '2002-05-18 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59955, 1527, 1701, '<td valign="top">This had me wondering which way was up!  Great composition, but I think a color photograph would have added to the mixed up feeling the composition seemed to be trying to convey.  Great job overall though.</td>', 'This had me wondering which way was up!  Great composition, but I think a color photograph would have added to the mixed up feeling the composition seemed to be trying to convey.  Great job overall though.', '2002-05-18 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59956, 1527, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph.  I love the idea, and the bleached whites of the photo really pulls the effect off well.  Good job.</td>', 'Awesome photograph.  I love the idea, and the bleached whites of the photo really pulls the effect off well.  Good job.', '2002-05-19 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59957, 1527, 587, '<td valign="top">intriguing. I like it.</td>', 'intriguing. I like it.', '2002-05-19 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59958, 1527, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overexposed.</td>', 'Seems a little overexposed.', '2002-05-19 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59959, 1527, 47, '<td valign="top">the story behind the photograph: layne stayley (alice in chains) died of a heroin overdose recently, and was found on the floor of his apartment.. two weeks later. one can only imagine the stench. i practically dislocated my shoulder taking this shot. it was backlit with a lamp that was sitting on my computer chair. and yes. that''s my computer on the right. i focused with the foor i think. i wanted it fuzzy and washed out.. ive done some drugs but i can only guess at what heroin must feel like.<br/><br/>&amp;gt; Looks like a Hitchcock angle...?<br/>i wish i was as cool as hitchcock.<br/><br/>apparently the only person that got the title right off the bat was ryan.</td>', 'the story behind the photograph: layne stayley (alice in chains) died of a heroin overdose recently, and was found on the floor of his apartment.. two weeks later. one can only imagine the stench. i practically dislocated my shoulder taking this shot. it was backlit with a lamp that was sitting on my computer chair. and yes. that''s my computer on the right. i focused with the foor i think. i wanted it fuzzy and washed out.. ive done some drugs but i can only guess at what heroin must feel like.&gt; Looks like a Hitchcock angle...?i wish i was as cool as hitchcock.apparently the only person that got the title right off the bat was ryan.', '2002-05-20 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
