(59995, 1534, 963, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2002-05-13 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59996, 1534, 1, '<td valign="top">Grainy and too dark.  I think this could''ve worked out well with more light and less grain.</td>', 'Grainy and too dark.  I think this could''ve worked out well with more light and less grain.', '2002-05-13 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59997, 1534, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m lame.  I see what I''d guess to be clouds, but to be honest, I can''t be certain.  I guess I''ll look at it as an interesting abstract.  It has a very painterly feeling to it, but not so much a photographic one.  I don''t have any suggestions because I simply don''t know for sure what you were going for.</td>', 'OK, I''m lame.  I see what I''d guess to be clouds, but to be honest, I can''t be certain.  I guess I''ll look at it as an interesting abstract.  It has a very painterly feeling to it, but not so much a photographic one.  I don''t have any suggestions because I simply don''t know for sure what you were going for.', '2002-05-13 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59998, 1534, 862, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2002-05-14 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59999, 1534, 1528, '<td valign="top">Have to tell you this image looks MUCH better against a grey background.<br/>Scores high in emotion, lil low in technique.  Though this would be a tough shot to get crisp by all measures!</td>', 'Have to tell you this image looks MUCH better against a grey background.Scores high in emotion, lil low in technique.  Though this would be a tough shot to get crisp by all measures!', '2002-05-14 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60000, 1534, 933, '<td valign="top">Just a teensy weensy bit to dark...</td>', 'Just a teensy weensy bit to dark...', '2002-05-14 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60001, 1534, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very dark (both photo and concept)  I like it, but don''t feel I can score it very highly.  Photo 6 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 5 total 6</td>', 'Very dark (both photo and concept)  I like it, but don''t feel I can score it very highly.  Photo 6 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 5 total 6', '2002-05-14 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60002, 1534, 387, '<td valign="top">maybe I missed it, but I don''t get the photo. is it of a painting?</td>', 'maybe I missed it, but I don''t get the photo. is it of a painting?', '2002-05-14 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60003, 1534, 889, '<td valign="top">I think those are clouds, but I cant tell enough of whats there to give a real vote.</td>', 'I think those are clouds, but I cant tell enough of whats there to give a real vote.', '2002-05-15 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60004, 1534, 1455, '<td valign="top">A little Dark, but pretty</td>', 'A little Dark, but pretty', '2002-05-15 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60005, 1534, 878, '<td valign="top">Even if my monitor was calibrated to the n''th degree I am sure I still would be able to make out this shot.  Its just too dark grainy.  It looks like clouds but not sure if they''re off a reflective surface.</td>', 'Even if my monitor was calibrated to the n''th degree I am sure I still would be able to make out this shot.  Its just too dark grainy.  It looks like clouds but not sure if they''re off a reflective surface.', '2002-05-15 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60006, 1534, 313, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting, interesting composition.  i wish i could give it a higher vote because i like it, but i don''t think it captures the nature of the challenge.</td>', 'beautiful lighting, interesting composition.  i wish i could give it a higher vote because i like it, but i don''t think it captures the nature of the challenge.', '2002-05-15 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60007, 1534, 714, '<td valign="top">Did you try to shoot something other then this?  Anything?</td>', 'Did you try to shoot something other then this?  Anything?', '2002-05-17 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60008, 1534, 1584, '<td valign="top">Ooops. Some grey sneaked in this black shot.</td>', 'Ooops. Some grey sneaked in this black shot.', '2002-05-18 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60009, 1534, 332, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting after William Turner.</td>', 'Looks like a painting after William Turner.', '2002-05-19 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60010, 1535, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the way it looks like everything is falling...cool!</td>', 'I like the way it looks like everything is falling...cool!', '2002-05-13 07:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60011, 1535, 327, '<td valign="top">Hee hee......I like it! Good work, good shot, good idea.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Hee hee......I like it! Good work, good shot, good idea.Nice work.', '2002-05-13 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60012, 1535, 772, '<td valign="top">I like black and whites... this is a neat entry to this challenge too... i think your light source may have been a tad bright for this one.  maybe a little negative brightness and positive contrast adjustments would have improved the overall result.  Nice work!</td>', 'I like black and whites... this is a neat entry to this challenge too... i think your light source may have been a tad bright for this one.  maybe a little negative brightness and positive contrast adjustments would have improved the overall result.  Nice work!', '2002-05-13 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60013, 1535, 1599, '<td valign="top">no sence</td>', 'no sence', '2002-05-13 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60014, 1535, 472, '<td valign="top">HA! this is too funny.  i love the surrealism in this picture!!!!! and it works great in a black and white</td>', 'HA! this is too funny.  i love the surrealism in this picture!!!!! and it works great in a black and white', '2002-05-13 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60015, 1535, 1143, '<td valign="top">You might try masking back in some spot color. Cute though.</td>', 'You might try masking back in some spot color. Cute though.', '2002-05-13 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60016, 1535, 862, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation; however, it appears a little washed out.</td>', 'Nice presentation; however, it appears a little washed out.', '2002-05-14 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60017, 1535, 1005, '<td valign="top">Photo 9 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'Photo 9 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60018, 1535, 387, '<td valign="top">Forgive me, I''m going to be pretty harsh. There seems to be a lack of control over the photographic process. The subject is unclear and the scene is cluttered. The contrast is nice, but the lighting a bit harsh. These are only my opinions, please don''t give up. The idea was a creative one.</td>', 'Forgive me, I''m going to be pretty harsh. There seems to be a lack of control over the photographic process. The subject is unclear and the scene is cluttered. The contrast is nice, but the lighting a bit harsh. These are only my opinions, please don''t give up. The idea was a creative one.', '2002-05-14 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60019, 1535, 675, '<td valign="top">weird at best, b &amp; w doesn''t really help either</td>', 'weird at best, b & w doesn''t really help either', '2002-05-14 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60020, 1535, 1070, '<td valign="top">i love b&amp;w photos</td>', 'i love b&w photos', '2002-05-18 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60021, 1535, 811, '<td valign="top">What I really like about this picture is that some of the items are upside down, and some are not so the viewer''s head starts spinning.  Black and white work well, because I assume it was very colorful and all of the colors would have been competing for attention.</td>', 'What I really like about this picture is that some of the items are upside down, and some are not so the viewer''s head starts spinning.  Black and white work well, because I assume it was very colorful and all of the colors would have been competing for attention.', '2002-05-18 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60022, 1535, 1078, '<td valign="top">Everytime I looked at the thumbnail on this one, I wondered why I voted it so high, and I had to continually remind myself that is was much better bigger.  My only suggestion would be maybe a bit more of a crop to remove some of that "dead" space at the bottom of the picture.  Hard to do without losing some of the other cool stuff at the sides -- unless maybe you went with the 640x427 image size...</td>', 'Everytime I looked at the thumbnail on this one, I wondered why I voted it so high, and I had to continually remind myself that is was much better bigger.  My only suggestion would be maybe a bit more of a crop to remove some of that "dead" space at the bottom of the picture.  Hard to do without losing some of the other cool stuff at the sides -- unless maybe you went with the 640x427 image size...', '2002-05-19 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60023, 1535, 1, '<td valign="top">Quite the strange colarboration of objects in the picture.  Wondering how you pulled it all off.</td>', 'Quite the strange colarboration of objects in the picture.  Wondering how you pulled it all off.', '2002-05-19 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60024, 1537, 1037, '<td valign="top">I looked at this one for a while, because at first glance I didn''t quite like it, then the title and the state of that bike started making me nostalgic (sniff). Also, the composition of it made my eyes linger for a while, because it''s really very effective. The shapes you captured out of a mundane object are lovely. It''s a great approach to this challenge.</td>', 'I looked at this one for a while, because at first glance I didn''t quite like it, then the title and the state of that bike started making me nostalgic (sniff). Also, the composition of it made my eyes linger for a while, because it''s really very effective. The shapes you captured out of a mundane object are lovely. It''s a great approach to this challenge.', '2002-05-13 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60025, 1537, 327, '<td valign="top">&amp;lt;g&amp;gt; nice job, love the shadow.</td>', '&lt;g&gt; nice job, love the shadow.', '2002-05-13 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60026, 1537, 772, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s an old 10-speed!  haven''t seen one like that in quite a while!  Good shot!</td>', 'Now, that''s an old 10-speed!  haven''t seen one like that in quite a while!  Good shot!', '2002-05-13 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60027, 1537, 1599, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-05-13 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60028, 1537, 1, '<td valign="top">A very good idea.  I think the light might be too bright on the subject... maybe a shot later in the day would''ve gotten you softer colors.</td>', 'A very good idea.  I think the light might be too bright on the subject... maybe a shot later in the day would''ve gotten you softer colors.', '2002-05-14 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60029, 1537, 1005, '<td valign="top">Photo is good, excitement low.  Photo 9 Creativity 4 Upsidedown 7 total 6</td>', 'Photo is good, excitement low.  Photo 9 Creativity 4 Upsidedown 7 total 6', '2002-05-14 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60030, 1537, 656, '<td valign="top">not sure about the title.  The shadows seem to be too much under the frame for me, maybe a different time of day ?</td>', 'not sure about the title.  The shadows seem to be too much under the frame for me, maybe a different time of day ?', '2002-05-14 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60031, 1537, 1529, '<td valign="top">This would have more emotional impact if it was in some other way askew. For example if the bike wasn''t quite vertical, or if you change the composition to have the bike off center and less prominently framed.</td>', 'This would have more emotional impact if it was in some other way askew. For example if the bike wasn''t quite vertical, or if you change the composition to have the bike off center and less prominently framed.', '2002-05-14 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60032, 1537, 1169, '<td valign="top">good title</td>', 'good title', '2002-05-15 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60033, 1537, 1570, '<td valign="top">this picture failed to excite me...</td>', 'this picture failed to excite me...', '2002-05-15 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60034, 1537, 675, '<td valign="top">other bike one is better</td>', 'other bike one is better', '2002-05-17 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60035, 1537, 1070, '<td valign="top">don''t like this at all... it could have been done so much better</td>', 'don''t like this at all... it could have been done so much better', '2002-05-18 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60036, 1537, 1379, '<td valign="top">The title makes it for me....</td>', 'The title makes it for me....', '2002-05-19 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60037, 1541, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the b&amp;w and the comp is very nice here. Clean, clear and on topic for the challenge. Nice work.</td>', 'Love the b&w and the comp is very nice here. Clean, clear and on topic for the challenge. Nice work.', '2002-05-13 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60038, 1541, 203, '<td valign="top">Moonlight Sonata?  Not much to go on.</td>', 'Moonlight Sonata?  Not much to go on.', '2002-05-13 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60039, 1541, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2002-05-13 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60040, 1541, 1379, '<td valign="top">So crisp and elegant...</td>', 'So crisp and elegant...', '2002-05-13 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60041, 1541, 189, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that "Rind Photo" that won that challenge few back.</td>', 'Reminds me of that "Rind Photo" that won that challenge few back.', '2002-05-13 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60042, 1541, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept.  I was planning on doing something similar with a bible and a pair of rim-wire glasses but I didn''t do it... Very nice!</td>', 'I really like this concept.  I was planning on doing something similar with a bible and a pair of rim-wire glasses but I didn''t do it... Very nice!', '2002-05-13 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(60043, 1541, 1599, '<td valign="top">nah</td>', 'nah', '2002-05-13 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60044, 1541, 472, '<td valign="top">this picture is extremely creative, and brilliantly executed. my hat is off to you sir. : )</td>', 'this picture is extremely creative, and brilliantly executed. my hat is off to you sir. : )', '2002-05-13 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60045, 1541, 1031, '<td valign="top">A "classic" style photo...</td>', 'A "classic" style photo...', '2002-05-14 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60046, 1541, 543, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I''d rather have the lenses at front and in focus with the temples receding into the blur.</td>', 'Pretty.  I''d rather have the lenses at front and in focus with the temples receding into the blur.', '2002-05-14 05:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60047, 1541, 387, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you chose THAT piece for a background. There''s no accounting for taste in music. Your taste in composing macro photos is pretty good though! you get an A#!</td>', 'I can''t believe you chose THAT piece for a background. There''s no accounting for taste in music. Your taste in composing macro photos is pretty good though! you get an A#!', '2002-05-14 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60048, 1541, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Interesting concept.  I like what you kept in the photo and what you left out.</td>', 'Nice detail.  Interesting concept.  I like what you kept in the photo and what you left out.', '2002-05-14 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60049, 1541, 1529, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the focal point farther back -- to see the glasses more clearly.</td>', 'I would prefer the focal point farther back -- to see the glasses more clearly.', '2002-05-14 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60050, 1541, 675, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-05-14 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60051, 1541, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. I like it, but I would prefer to have a greater DOF so that the glasses are in focus.</td>', 'Nice and simple. I like it, but I would prefer to have a greater DOF so that the glasses are in focus.', '2002-05-14 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60052, 1541, 107, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.</td>', 'very nicely done.', '2002-05-15 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60053, 1541, 889, '<td valign="top">note the nice macro shot. Is this violin or piano music? Its in good focus, thou I bet some people will have a hard time telling itts upside down.<br/>Although you do have the poco shoing that it is.</td>', 'note the nice macro shot. Is this violin or piano music? Its in good focus, thou I bet some people will have a hard time telling itts upside down.Although you do have the poco shoing that it is.', '2002-05-15 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60054, 1541, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, fits the challenge, no glaring technical issues  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice photo, fits the challenge, no glaring technical issues  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-15 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60055, 1541, 878, '<td valign="top">Although I am a fan of 64th note arpeggios and trills.  Its not grabbing with respect to the challenge subject.  Technically its a great shot with good depth of feild, detail, and angle of shot.  I have to give this more credit for the shot than the challenge.</td>', 'Although I am a fan of 64th note arpeggios and trills.  Its not grabbing with respect to the challenge subject.  Technically its a great shot with good depth of feild, detail, and angle of shot.  I have to give this more credit for the shot than the challenge.', '2002-05-15 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60056, 1541, 1336, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like this photo because it''s unique.</td>', 'very nice.  i like this photo because it''s unique.', '2002-05-15 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60057, 1541, 259, '<td valign="top">nice photo, the only advise i have would be to make the right bottom corner more in focus</td>', 'nice photo, the only advise i have would be to make the right bottom corner more in focus', '2002-05-16 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60058, 1541, 1066, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and well photographed.<br/><br/>All that you need for a great photo.<br/><br/>One of my 10 best.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and well photographed.All that you need for a great photo.One of my 10 best.', '2002-05-17 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60059, 1541, 1054, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and subtle!</td>', 'Beautiful, and subtle!', '2002-05-18 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60060, 1541, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot is excellent.  The focus at the front leads you to the blurry-ish background and forces you to look back to the foreground.  As a musician, it was obvious to me immediately that it was upside down, but I figure someone will question it.</td>', 'This shot is excellent.  The focus at the front leads you to the blurry-ish background and forces you to look back to the foreground.  As a musician, it was obvious to me immediately that it was upside down, but I figure someone will question it.', '2002-05-18 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60061, 1541, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''ll venture to guess that a number of people don''t like the depth of field -- I do.  I question a little bit, however, the choice of the focal plain -- I would have pushed it back a little toward the glasses themselves, and not on the earpiece.  But that''s a preference.  The color seems not quite right -- I think this would make a great black and white, but the faint maroonish cast to everything doesn''t seem appropriate to me.</td>', 'I''ll venture to guess that a number of people don''t like the depth of field -- I do.  I question a little bit, however, the choice of the focal plain -- I would have pushed it back a little toward the glasses themselves, and not on the earpiece.  But that''s a preference.  The color seems not quite right -- I think this would make a great black and white, but the faint maroonish cast to everything doesn''t seem appropriate to me.', '2002-05-19 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60062, 1541, 737, '<td valign="top">Elegant - in my top 10</td>', 'Elegant - in my top 10', '2002-05-19 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60063, 1541, 1, '<td valign="top">Your focus is so close to the bottom of the shot, I feel it needs to be on the eye glass, moreso in the middle of the image.</td>', 'Your focus is so close to the bottom of the shot, I feel it needs to be on the eye glass, moreso in the middle of the image.', '2002-05-19 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60064, 1541, 1211, '<td valign="top">It''s the Grieg Piano Concerto, Cadenza (1st Mvt), for those wondering.</td>', 'It''s the Grieg Piano Concerto, Cadenza (1st Mvt), for those wondering.', '2002-05-20 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60065, 1541, 1211, '<td valign="top">It''s the Grieg Piano Concerto, Cadenza (1st Mvt), for those wondering.</td>', 'It''s the Grieg Piano Concerto, Cadenza (1st Mvt), for those wondering.', '2002-05-20 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60066, 1544, 1485, '<td valign="top">hard to figure out what that is.</td>', 'hard to figure out what that is.', '2002-05-13 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60067, 1544, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and work.<br/></td>', 'Creative idea and work.', '2002-05-13 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60068, 1544, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photograph and you have done a nice job of getting clear focus on the ''bubble'' here.  If the bubble itself or the reflection in the bubble are upside down, I''m having a difficult time determining that from the photo.</td>', 'This is a cool photograph and you have done a nice job of getting clear focus on the ''bubble'' here.  If the bubble itself or the reflection in the bubble are upside down, I''m having a difficult time determining that from the photo.', '2002-05-13 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60069, 1544, 1599, '<td valign="top">what?</td>', 'what?', '2002-05-13 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60070, 1544, 675, '<td valign="top">how is this an anti gravity bubble? seems like it''s doing the right thing here...</td>', 'how is this an anti gravity bubble? seems like it''s doing the right thing here...', '2002-05-14 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60071, 1544, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept.  Did you try any closer to the bubble? (fill the frame 20% to 40% more?)  I do like the "framing", just less of it.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 9 total 9</td>', 'Very cool concept.  Did you try any closer to the bubble? (fill the frame 20% to 40% more?)  I do like the "framing", just less of it.Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 9 total 9', '2002-05-15 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60072, 1544, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming it''s upside down, although I can''t be certain -- in fact, I''d have to say that it looks like a water drop on whatever the surface is moving down, and not up.  I''m very intrigued by what you can see inside the bubble/droplet -- I don''t know if it''s possible or not (if your camera has a decent macro), but if you could get closer, I think that would be really cool.</td>', 'I''m assuming it''s upside down, although I can''t be certain -- in fact, I''d have to say that it looks like a water drop on whatever the surface is moving down, and not up.  I''m very intrigued by what you can see inside the bubble/droplet -- I don''t know if it''s possible or not (if your camera has a decent macro), but if you could get closer, I think that would be really cool.', '2002-05-15 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60073, 1544, 387, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that you tried to show an upside down road (?) in a water drop. Pehaps getting closer, if possible, might have helped.</td>', 'I get the feeling that you tried to show an upside down road (?) in a water drop. Pehaps getting closer, if possible, might have helped.', '2002-05-17 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60074, 1544, 1, '<td valign="top">Very bland subject, the dirty surface isn''t appealing.</td>', 'Very bland subject, the dirty surface isn''t appealing.', '2002-05-19 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60075, 1544, 587, '<td valign="top">sorry, no idea what this is.</td>', 'sorry, no idea what this is.', '2002-05-19 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60076, 1544, 878, '<td valign="top">Thanks to the people that got this one.  Yes it would of been nicer if I was able to get the drop of water larger in the shot, my Macro isnt all that great on my camera.  This was actually a shot with the zoom and standing farther away from the subject. <br/><br/>For those of you who didnt get it, thanks for voting (even if they were not high).  I am pleased to see that that many people looked at my shot.  The concept of the shot was to capture the upside down road in the drop of water on a train.  Its a bit harder to do than you would think using zoom vs macro.  Macro on my Fuji 2800 is somewhat poor, unfortuantely I found out about a Macro trick after this shot was submitted.  I will redo the shot for my own sake at another time. <br/><br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks to the people that got this one.  Yes it would of been nicer if I was able to get the drop of water larger in the shot, my Macro isnt all that great on my camera.  This was actually a shot with the zoom and standing farther away from the subject. For those of you who didnt get it, thanks for voting (even if they were not high).  I am pleased to see that that many people looked at my shot.  The concept of the shot was to capture the upside down road in the drop of water on a train.  Its a bit harder to do than you would think using zoom vs macro.  Macro on my Fuji 2800 is somewhat poor, unfortuantely I found out about a Macro trick after this shot was submitted.  I will redo the shot for my own sake at another time. ', '2002-05-20 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60077, 1545, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling shot. Great kitty.<br/>Very on topic for the challenge. Good wrok.<br/></td>', 'Darling shot. Great kitty.Very on topic for the challenge. Good wrok.', '2002-05-13 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
