(60097, 1545, 1446, '<td valign="top">Composition-Good job isolating the subject.  Background-works with this picture,does not add or distract. Except to make the cat look very comfy, which was perhaps the point. Technical-There is nothing really wrong with it. Overall impression- Technically its a good shot, I might have changed the framing slightly to leave less "background" in the lower right. I also might have tried to eliminate the white specks thruout.  ....7.</td>', 'Composition-Good job isolating the subject.  Background-works with this picture,does not add or distract. Except to make the cat look very comfy, which was perhaps the point. Technical-There is nothing really wrong with it. Overall impression- Technically its a good shot, I might have changed the framing slightly to leave less "background" in the lower right. I also might have tried to eliminate the white specks thruout.  ....7.', '2002-05-17 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60098, 1545, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.  Fun positioning of the cat in the frame.  Personal preference would be to make it a little bit more contrasty (make the darks a bit darker).  A few parts of the cat seem to be out of focus (front paws, tail) -- was the cat moving during the shot, or is it just a little bit too shallow DOF?</td>', 'Nice black and white.  Fun positioning of the cat in the frame.  Personal preference would be to make it a little bit more contrasty (make the darks a bit darker).  A few parts of the cat seem to be out of focus (front paws, tail) -- was the cat moving during the shot, or is it just a little bit too shallow DOF?', '2002-05-17 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
