(60152, 1549, 1528, '<td valign="top">I like it!<br/>I think it''d be better flipped over though, and still cover the ''upside-down'' base.<br/>The leaves going across their faces on the upright image bothers me.<br/>Beautiful, colorful image. Great composition.</td>', 'I like it!I think it''d be better flipped over though, and still cover the ''upside-down'' base.The leaves going across their faces on the upright image bothers me.Beautiful, colorful image. Great composition.', '2002-05-14 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
