(60182, 1551, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting could use some work.  The flash seems to be overkill (or whatever frontal light you''re using).</td>', 'I think the lighting could use some work.  The flash seems to be overkill (or whatever frontal light you''re using).', '2002-05-19 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
