(60193, 1553, 1169, '<td valign="top">hard to figure out what the photo is, so hard in fact that i still don''t know</td>', 'hard to figure out what the photo is, so hard in fact that i still don''t know', '2002-05-16 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60194, 1553, 1446, '<td valign="top">Composition- Good job isolating the subject,assuming you are trying to show the bolt and the serial number as your subject.  The 2 screws at the bottom might be a distraction.  Perhaps they belong completely in the shot, might have helped with framing.  Background- all part of the whole, no way to change it and no reason to either. Technical- very nice focus, good exposure especially with the use of a flash.  Overall Impression- Meets the challenge, technically good, at the least I am wondering what this is part of (garbage disposal?) Not a terribly interesting subject to begin with, but a good photo of it anyway... 7.</td>', 'Composition- Good job isolating the subject,assuming you are trying to show the bolt and the serial number as your subject.  The 2 screws at the bottom might be a distraction.  Perhaps they belong completely in the shot, might have helped with framing.  Background- all part of the whole, no way to change it and no reason to either. Technical- very nice focus, good exposure especially with the use of a flash.  Overall Impression- Meets the challenge, technically good, at the least I am wondering what this is part of (garbage disposal?) Not a terribly interesting subject to begin with, but a good photo of it anyway... 7.', '2002-05-17 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60195, 1553, 1078, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract.  That one spot of color on the washer(?) is great.  I wish the code along the left was more perfectly parallel to the image boundary, but it also looks like it might be on a curved surface and so that might not be possible.</td>', 'Cool abstract.  That one spot of color on the washer(?) is great.  I wish the code along the left was more perfectly parallel to the image boundary, but it also looks like it might be on a curved surface and so that might not be possible.', '2002-05-17 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60196, 1554, 1269, '<td valign="top">funny subject. crappy lighting</td>', 'funny subject. crappy lighting', '2002-05-13 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60197, 1554, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative, clever, good humor shot.<br/>Little blown out with the flash on the legs and the background is dark. <br/>Still this is just a wonderful idea.</td>', 'Creative, clever, good humor shot.Little blown out with the flash on the legs and the background is dark. Still this is just a wonderful idea.', '2002-05-13 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60198, 1554, 1378, '<td valign="top">Different.... The center is way too dark in camparison to the sneakers.</td>', 'Different.... The center is way too dark in camparison to the sneakers.', '2002-05-13 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60199, 1554, 1520, '<td valign="top">Although this photo doesn''t seem to me to be the best techinically, I love the idea!  Brownie points for the idea!   Holy creative-guy, batman!  (get it?  batman...upside down? ..umm...never mind)</td>', 'Although this photo doesn''t seem to me to be the best techinically, I love the idea!  Brownie points for the idea!   Holy creative-guy, batman!  (get it?  batman...upside down? ..umm...never mind)', '2002-05-13 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
