(60205, 1554, 1357, '<td valign="top">I tried to do one of these shots too while laying on my bedroom floor. Unfortunately I could get a decent result that I liked. I think your legs are too bright and the ceiling is too dark &amp; no, that`s not white socks is it ? They went out years ago. I like the chandelier as it adds good depthe to this picture.</td>', 'I tried to do one of these shots too while laying on my bedroom floor. Unfortunately I could get a decent result that I liked. I think your legs are too bright and the ceiling is too dark & no, that`s not white socks is it ? They went out years ago. I like the chandelier as it adds good depthe to this picture.', '2002-05-14 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60206, 1554, 675, '<td valign="top">is the angry giant back for more?</td>', 'is the angry giant back for more?', '2002-05-14 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
