(60209, 1554, 878, '<td valign="top">Legs are overexposed while the ceiling is under exposed.  Good Idea but the shot was not there technically.</td>', 'Legs are overexposed while the ceiling is under exposed.  Good Idea but the shot was not there technically.', '2002-05-15 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
