(60221, 1555, 1005, '<td valign="top">For the challenge, I would have thought "from the bottom".  Nice photo.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 5 total 7<br/>Save this idea for "from the top down" challenge.</td>', 'For the challenge, I would have thought "from the bottom".  Nice photo.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 5 total 7Save this idea for "from the top down" challenge.', '2002-05-14 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
