(60263, 1558, 245, '<td valign="top">The expresion on that face is excellent, so are the colors! The focus and detail make this feel so lush. Very nice!!!</td>', 'The expresion on that face is excellent, so are the colors! The focus and detail make this feel so lush. Very nice!!!', '2002-05-14 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
