(60291, 1559, 1360, '<td valign="top">I was going to submit a very boring shot of my face, upside down, reflected inside a collander.  I was taking my daily walk through the park, when I noticed this fence...  It just spoke to me.  The things i''m most dissapointed with this picture:<br/><br/> I couldnt get more of it in focus.  Or less of it, in focus, actually.  I''d loved if I could get the grass a lot fuzzier.<br/><br/>After submitting it, I also wish that I could have gotten the angle different.  I took this picture almost directly perpinduclar with the fence... I think i''d have liked it better if I was out more, and looking back at the fence.</td>', 'I was going to submit a very boring shot of my face, upside down, reflected inside a collander.  I was taking my daily walk through the park, when I noticed this fence...  It just spoke to me.  The things i''m most dissapointed with this picture: I couldnt get more of it in focus.  Or less of it, in focus, actually.  I''d loved if I could get the grass a lot fuzzier.After submitting it, I also wish that I could have gotten the angle different.  I took this picture almost directly perpinduclar with the fence... I think i''d have liked it better if I was out more, and looking back at the fence.', '2002-05-20 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
