(60387, 1570, 1528, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, and composition.<br/>The blurriness throws me off, as unintentional ?!?!<br/>And i can''t make out what''s in the top righthand corner.<br/>Nice.</td>', 'Love the concept, and composition.The blurriness throws me off, as unintentional ?!?!And i can''t make out what''s in the top righthand corner.Nice.', '2002-05-13 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60388, 1570, 1078, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but I think the lack of any focus ruins it.  I like the way the glasses are at different heights.  (I''d also turn off the date function -- unless you think you need it for proof that it was taken in the specified time.  I don''t think you do.)</td>', 'An interesting shot, but I think the lack of any focus ruins it.  I like the way the glasses are at different heights.  (I''d also turn off the date function -- unless you think you need it for proof that it was taken in the specified time.  I don''t think you do.)', '2002-05-13 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60389, 1570, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really, really well composed... I love the way the glass stems create those tiers, and the background colour works well with the glasses. It''s a real shame it''s not focussed better!</td>', 'This is really, really well composed... I love the way the glass stems create those tiers, and the background colour works well with the glasses. It''s a real shame it''s not focussed better!', '2002-05-13 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
