(60527, 1585, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, this is going to sound hypercritical (like I couldn''t think of anything else to say) and in some respects, I guess it is.  I can''t see anything about the photo I would "fix".  Nice focal depth, good lighting and contrast, etc.  But the photo as a whole just doesn''t do it for me.  That''s not doing anything to my score (it''s very high), but I thought you might like to know.That''s just a personal thing and you are certainly welcome to ignore it.</td>', 'OK, this is going to sound hypercritical (like I couldn''t think of anything else to say) and in some respects, I guess it is.  I can''t see anything about the photo I would "fix".  Nice focal depth, good lighting and contrast, etc.  But the photo as a whole just doesn''t do it for me.  That''s not doing anything to my score (it''s very high), but I thought you might like to know.That''s just a personal thing and you are certainly welcome to ignore it.', '2002-05-16 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60528, 1585, 675, '<td valign="top">that bitch be crazy...seriously though the lighting is great here, and the composition is one of a kind</td>', 'that bitch be crazy...seriously though the lighting is great here, and the composition is one of a kind', '2002-05-17 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60529, 1585, 1446, '<td valign="top">Composition-good job bringing the eye to the coin.  Nice use of diagonal lines, selective DOF to isolate the subject.  Background-Subject to background relationship may be misunderstood by some.  Camera Work/Technical- What can I say its very good! Overall Opinion- A good shot. No big emotional thing happening, but the overall technical outweighs that part.  The use of a foreign coin does bring a lot of interest to it and in fact may tie the background in by featuring a queen. Overall I like it.  ... 8.</td>', 'Composition-good job bringing the eye to the coin.  Nice use of diagonal lines, selective DOF to isolate the subject.  Background-Subject to background relationship may be misunderstood by some.  Camera Work/Technical- What can I say its very good! Overall Opinion- A good shot. No big emotional thing happening, but the overall technical outweighs that part.  The use of a foreign coin does bring a lot of interest to it and in fact may tie the background in by featuring a queen. Overall I like it.  ... 8.', '2002-05-17 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
