(60552, 1586, 1078, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this seems a little too dark and perhaps a bit yellow.  The focus on sculpture also seems a little soft -- I can''t tell if that''s an out of focus problem, or a lower end camera problem.  I think a tighter, vertical crop would have helped focus on the statue and less on all the other things (the toes at the bottom, the other statue to the right, etc).</td>', 'The lighting on this seems a little too dark and perhaps a bit yellow.  The focus on sculpture also seems a little soft -- I can''t tell if that''s an out of focus problem, or a lower end camera problem.  I think a tighter, vertical crop would have helped focus on the statue and less on all the other things (the toes at the bottom, the other statue to the right, etc).', '2002-05-19 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
