(60615, 1590, 543, '<td valign="top">Good looking kid, and a well set scene.  Pretty good tones - I prefer a little more contrast, but this probably accurately reflects the quality of the available light.  A bit dark, though.  I''d set gamma to 1.1 and/or increase the brightness just a notch.</td>', 'Good looking kid, and a well set scene.  Pretty good tones - I prefer a little more contrast, but this probably accurately reflects the quality of the available light.  A bit dark, though.  I''d set gamma to 1.1 and/or increase the brightness just a notch.', '2002-05-15 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
