(60625, 1590, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, very good composition, and I love that almost everything is in sharp focus. The hanging toilet paper adds a nice slight oomph to add to the challenge. I would have tried getting about 3 or 4 inches less of the floor, but it''s tight in there so there might not have been much space to maneuver, plus you''ve got something on the wall you have to deal with.  The horizon line is not straight, but that works in this case because the angle creates a good feeling of depth from the lines on the floor and the walls to the corners.</td>', 'Nice photo, very good composition, and I love that almost everything is in sharp focus. The hanging toilet paper adds a nice slight oomph to add to the challenge. I would have tried getting about 3 or 4 inches less of the floor, but it''s tight in there so there might not have been much space to maneuver, plus you''ve got something on the wall you have to deal with.  The horizon line is not straight, but that works in this case because the angle creates a good feeling of depth from the lines on the floor and the walls to the corners.', '2002-05-18 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60626, 1590, 811, '<td valign="top">This was too cute!  I hope he got an extra 10% at least in his allowance (if he has one).  I really like the fact that he is oblivious to the camera and it looks, shall I say, natural.  The black and white also works well for me.</td>', 'This was too cute!  I hope he got an extra 10% at least in his allowance (if he has one).  I really like the fact that he is oblivious to the camera and it looks, shall I say, natural.  The black and white also works well for me.', '2002-05-18 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
