(60663, 1591, 875, '<td valign="top">A clever idea well executed!</td>', 'A clever idea well executed!', '2002-05-17 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60664, 1591, 1066, '<td valign="top">If this is a rip-off of another poster then you only get an 8 but I am going to assume this is original and as such deserves a 10 and to win this week .<br/><br/>On of my 5 best shots this week and my favorite.<br/><br/>If there is one thing wrong with this photo I ant to hear about it cause I am missing it.  Perfection.</td>', 'If this is a rip-off of another poster then you only get an 8 but I am going to assume this is original and as such deserves a 10 and to win this week .On of my 5 best shots this week and my favorite.If there is one thing wrong with this photo I ant to hear about it cause I am missing it.  Perfection.', '2002-05-17 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
