(60667, 1591, 811, '<td valign="top">Man, I hate it when this happens. The change on the floor is a nice touch.  I like the black and white, and the simplicity of the shot.</td>', 'Man, I hate it when this happens. The change on the floor is a nice touch.  I like the black and white, and the simplicity of the shot.', '2002-05-18 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60668, 1591, 587, '<td valign="top">great imagination!! This is one of my favorites. the only thing I wish wasn''t there was the back of the pants between the feet, distracting. great photo.</td>', 'great imagination!! This is one of my favorites. the only thing I wish wasn''t there was the back of the pants between the feet, distracting. great photo.', '2002-05-19 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
