(60670, 1591, 327, '<td valign="top">DANG~! but this was a good idea. You score for creativity, and fun. Just a great shot.<br/>CONGRATS to you.</td>', 'DANG~! but this was a good idea. You score for creativity, and fun. Just a great shot.CONGRATS to you.', '2002-05-20 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60671, 1591, 142, '<td valign="top">This was number one in my book.  Great job.</td>', 'This was number one in my book.  Great job.', '2002-05-20 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60672, 1591, 543, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for the comments, and especially the ones with suggestions (lighting and composition).  I had some trouble taming the little slave flash behind my left leg, and I think I kicked it out of position while hobbling onto the set.  Tough shot to do solo.  The waistband at the back bugged me a little, too, but after thirty or so attempts (hop into the frame, adjust pants, drop change, trip shutter, hop behind camera to check composition) I''d had enough.  Cheers!</td>', 'Thanks so much for the comments, and especially the ones with suggestions (lighting and composition).  I had some trouble taming the little slave flash behind my left leg, and I think I kicked it out of position while hobbling onto the set.  Tough shot to do solo.  The waistband at the back bugged me a little, too, but after thirty or so attempts (hop into the frame, adjust pants, drop change, trip shutter, hop behind camera to check composition) I''d had enough.  Cheers!', '2002-05-20 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(60673, 1593, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-05-13 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60674, 1593, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  I would prefer to have the butterfly in the center of the frame to make him more of the main subject.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  I would prefer to have the butterfly in the center of the frame to make him more of the main subject.', '2002-05-13 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60675, 1593, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I am glad you didn''t zoom in much tighter on the butterfly... the other objects in the photo give good reference to the butterfly being upside down :)</td>', 'Nice shot!  I am glad you didn''t zoom in much tighter on the butterfly... the other objects in the photo give good reference to the butterfly being upside down :)', '2002-05-13 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60676, 1593, 1599, '<td valign="top">this was good</td>', 'this was good', '2002-05-13 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
