(60679, 1593, 1031, '<td valign="top">Too bad you''re not allowed to lighten up the upper wings...beautiful detail on the lower wings...</td>', 'Too bad you''re not allowed to lighten up the upper wings...beautiful detail on the lower wings...', '2002-05-14 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
