(60704, 1594, 885, '<td valign="top">The lower left corner...and the upper right too.  They could just be a little darker.  If all three heads were disembodied as the one on the right is, this would be so outstanding.  Also, I wonder if you should have flipped it mirror image so the title reads left to right, but that may be just me being anal.</td>', 'The lower left corner...and the upper right too.  They could just be a little darker.  If all three heads were disembodied as the one on the right is, this would be so outstanding.  Also, I wonder if you should have flipped it mirror image so the title reads left to right, but that may be just me being anal.', '2002-05-14 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60705, 1594, 472, '<td valign="top">haha, i almost did this idea but doubtless would not have done it this well.  I think i would have shot this from a lower angle, not so much looking down at the heads.  would have also used soem external lighting from the side, to add some spark to the scene.</td>', 'haha, i almost did this idea but doubtless would not have done it this well.  I think i would have shot this from a lower angle, not so much looking down at the heads.  would have also used soem external lighting from the side, to add some spark to the scene.', '2002-05-14 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
