(60762, 1596, 749, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a bit brighter, to pick up the redness of the bricks and bring out the fleshtones a bit more... and having the feet out of the shot would have helped add a bit more mystery, but then it wouldn''t show this yoga position properly!</td>', 'Needs to be a bit brighter, to pick up the redness of the bricks and bring out the fleshtones a bit more... and having the feet out of the shot would have helped add a bit more mystery, but then it wouldn''t show this yoga position properly!', '2002-05-18 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
