(60807, 1600, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful bird... It''s not quite ''upside down'' but the shot scores well anyway :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful bird... It''s not quite ''upside down'' but the shot scores well anyway :)', '2002-05-13 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
