(60812, 1600, 543, '<td valign="top">Should have saved this for the upcoming ''upside right'' challenge.  Nice catch, tho.</td>', 'Should have saved this for the upcoming ''upside right'' challenge.  Nice catch, tho.', '2002-05-13 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60813, 1600, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo, but my first thought on seeing it wasn''t "upside down" (maybe sideways). Still rates high...</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo, but my first thought on seeing it wasn''t "upside down" (maybe sideways). Still rates high...', '2002-05-14 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60814, 1600, 1005, '<td valign="top">WOW, great photo (love those bird shots!!!!)  Isn''t he/she sideways?  Photo 10 +++++  Creativity 10 ++ Upsidedown 8  total 10<br/>(this is soooo good, I had to make an exception to the challenge) (you really nailed this one!)</td>', 'WOW, great photo (love those bird shots!!!!)  Isn''t he/she sideways?  Photo 10 +++++  Creativity 10 ++ Upsidedown 8  total 10(this is soooo good, I had to make an exception to the challenge) (you really nailed this one!)', '2002-05-14 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60815, 1600, 661, '<td valign="top">I love wildlife photos (recognizing that this looks like a trained bird).  Great angle.  Nice clean background.</td>', 'I love wildlife photos (recognizing that this looks like a trained bird).  Great angle.  Nice clean background.', '2002-05-14 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60816, 1600, 675, '<td valign="top">weird how his head is straight but his body is contorted...why the heck didn''t you have this one when the stop motion photo was needed</td>', 'weird how his head is straight but his body is contorted...why the heck didn''t you have this one when the stop motion photo was needed', '2002-05-14 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60817, 1600, 1143, '<td valign="top">This isn''t exactly upside down, but pretty close. It''s a beautiful bird and a great shot.</td>', 'This isn''t exactly upside down, but pretty close. It''s a beautiful bird and a great shot.', '2002-05-14 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60818, 1600, 107, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity and focus in capturing shot I could only dream of getting.  Perfect framing as well.</td>', 'Fantastic clarity and focus in capturing shot I could only dream of getting.  Perfect framing as well.', '2002-05-15 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60819, 1600, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is the great shot! but "Upside Down" - i don''t know...</td>', 'this is the great shot! but "Upside Down" - i don''t know...', '2002-05-15 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60820, 1600, 1540, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, but not upside down</td>', 'very nice shot, but not upside down', '2002-05-15 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60821, 1600, 1135, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photos but I don''t quite get the upside down part.</td>', 'One of my favorite photos but I don''t quite get the upside down part.', '2002-05-16 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60822, 1600, 1041, '<td valign="top">Totally awesome shot.  More 90 degrees than upside down but who cares.</td>', 'Totally awesome shot.  More 90 degrees than upside down but who cares.', '2002-05-16 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60823, 1600, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent photo.  in my opinion, it doesnt meet the challenge - the bird is sideways, not upside down</td>', 'this is an excellent photo.  in my opinion, it doesnt meet the challenge - the bird is sideways, not upside down', '2002-05-16 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60824, 1600, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I don''t think there can be argument on this one.  It''s a great shot -- love the orientation of the bird''s head in relation to the body.  (Would have given some others a run for their money in the stop motion challenge.)  However, I don''t think you can claim it''s upside down.  Two comments on the photo as is: If possible, shooting from a higher position to make it all grass as a background instead of that little bit of tree, and it seems to have a bit of a green tint on the bird -- that can be a hard thing to remove easily without messing up other things -- it may also just be a kind of visual illusion.  The bird might not be green but only seems that way because it''s surrounded by soo much strong green.</td>', 'OK, I don''t think there can be argument on this one.  It''s a great shot -- love the orientation of the bird''s head in relation to the body.  (Would have given some others a run for their money in the stop motion challenge.)  However, I don''t think you can claim it''s upside down.  Two comments on the photo as is: If possible, shooting from a higher position to make it all grass as a background instead of that little bit of tree, and it seems to have a bit of a green tint on the bird -- that can be a hard thing to remove easily without messing up other things -- it may also just be a kind of visual illusion.  The bird might not be green but only seems that way because it''s surrounded by soo much strong green.', '2002-05-16 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60825, 1600, 259, '<td valign="top">great picture of something hard to capture with clarity</td>', 'great picture of something hard to capture with clarity', '2002-05-16 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60826, 1600, 875, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the bird.  I''d love another dozen or so pixels on the top, so that the gap between the wingtip and the edge of the photo was larger.</td>', 'Very nice detail on the bird.  I''d love another dozen or so pixels on the top, so that the gap between the wingtip and the edge of the photo was larger.', '2002-05-18 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60827, 1600, 749, '<td valign="top">To use a comment system of someone else, photo 9, upside down 2, overall 5</td>', 'To use a comment system of someone else, photo 9, upside down 2, overall 5', '2002-05-18 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60828, 1600, 1584, '<td valign="top">How do they do that?</td>', 'How do they do that?', '2002-05-18 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60829, 1600, 1707, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  I have a special admiration for birds, and this photograph shows the unique aspects of what birds can do that we could only dream of. Thank you! I rate this photograph a 10! Nicely done. -NBT</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  I have a special admiration for birds, and this photograph shows the unique aspects of what birds can do that we could only dream of. Thank you! I rate this photograph a 10! Nicely done. -NBT', '2002-05-19 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60830, 1600, 1350, '<td valign="top">That is a wonderful shot! I work with birds of prey, so I know how difficult of a capture this had to be.  Hmmm...actually sideways instead of upside down. ;) A fantastic pic of a falcon in flight...Well done!</td>', 'That is a wonderful shot! I work with birds of prey, so I know how difficult of a capture this had to be.  Hmmm...actually sideways instead of upside down. ;) A fantastic pic of a falcon in flight...Well done!', '2002-05-19 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60831, 1601, 1485, '<td valign="top">hmm.. that''s more like ''underneath''</td>', 'hmm.. that''s more like ''underneath''', '2002-05-13 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60832, 1601, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like animal crackers too :)</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like animal crackers too :)', '2002-05-13 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60833, 1601, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though I wish the glass was a bit more clear.</td>', 'Nice idea, though I wish the glass was a bit more clear.', '2002-05-13 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60834, 1601, 472, '<td valign="top">this makes me think that angel children will now descend from the sky to dine! : )</td>', 'this makes me think that angel children will now descend from the sky to dine! : )', '2002-05-13 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60835, 1601, 1457, '<td valign="top">good idea.. I had it myself but no glass</td>', 'good idea.. I had it myself but no glass', '2002-05-13 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60836, 1601, 1570, '<td valign="top">the idea and the execution are both great!</td>', 'the idea and the execution are both great!', '2002-05-14 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60837, 1601, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 9</td>', 'Great idea!  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 9', '2002-05-14 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60838, 1601, 1143, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea though I think it could be executed better. It''s hard to figure out exactly what''s up there.</td>', 'Interesting idea though I think it could be executed better. It''s hard to figure out exactly what''s up there.', '2002-05-14 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60839, 1601, 107, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. let''s see.. orange juice, animal crackers, crisps... your making me hungry!  Shot very well executed.  Job well done.</td>', 'Hmm.. let''s see.. orange juice, animal crackers, crisps... your making me hungry!  Shot very well executed.  Job well done.', '2002-05-15 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60840, 1601, 885, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, would have worked for the ground up challenge too.  Almost everything is recognizable, except I''m not 100% sure about the peanut butter jar, if that''s what it is.  Good job.</td>', 'Cool idea, would have worked for the ground up challenge too.  Almost everything is recognizable, except I''m not 100% sure about the peanut butter jar, if that''s what it is.  Good job.', '2002-05-16 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60841, 1601, 675, '<td valign="top">i would try to block out the direct sunlight in this picture</td>', 'i would try to block out the direct sunlight in this picture', '2002-05-17 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60842, 1601, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome light!</td>', 'Awesome light!', '2002-05-19 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(60843, 1601, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, and so far I haven''t seen anyone else try it.  Great interpretation of upside-down.</td>', 'Very cool idea, and so far I haven''t seen anyone else try it.  Great interpretation of upside-down.', '2002-05-19 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60844, 1602, 1360, '<td valign="top">I would swear this is a photoshop job, but if it''s not, its awesome.  I espically love how the sky "up top" is all dark, and the sky "down below" is all bright, it makes for a powerful image.</td>', 'I would swear this is a photoshop job, but if it''s not, its awesome.  I espically love how the sky "up top" is all dark, and the sky "down below" is all bright, it makes for a powerful image.', '2002-05-13 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60845, 1602, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I have enjoyed all the water reflection shots in this challenge so far...</td>', 'Nice shot!  I have enjoyed all the water reflection shots in this challenge so far...', '2002-05-13 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60846, 1602, 327, '<td valign="top">pretty sky either direction.<br/></td>', 'pretty sky either direction.', '2002-05-13 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60847, 1602, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, but a little too dark rto see much detain in the fence line.</td>', 'Very nice concept, but a little too dark rto see much detain in the fence line.', '2002-05-13 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60848, 1602, 1175, '<td valign="top">Upside down, upside down is right side up. Don''t worry I don''t understand that either.  I think I would have liked this picture if you kept it right side up and then just moved the horizon up to the top 3rd line.  Might have also been better suited horizontally oriented.</td>', 'Upside down, upside down is right side up. Don''t worry I don''t understand that either.  I think I would have liked this picture if you kept it right side up and then just moved the horizon up to the top 3rd line.  Might have also been better suited horizontally oriented.', '2002-05-13 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60849, 1602, 1191, '<td valign="top">I had to look twice at this image, first I thought you had cheated and selectively altered the image, then I realised you have turned it 180 degrees.  Brilliant.</td>', 'I had to look twice at this image, first I thought you had cheated and selectively altered the image, then I realised you have turned it 180 degrees.  Brilliant.', '2002-05-13 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60850, 1602, 1599, '<td valign="top">very interesting, I love pictures that have ature in them.  You used very good light.  It looks very interesting.</td>', 'very interesting, I love pictures that have ature in them.  You used very good light.  It looks very interesting.', '2002-05-13 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60851, 1602, 472, '<td valign="top">veyr nice. i like how the reflection is more ''realistic'' than the reality above it.</td>', 'veyr nice. i like how the reflection is more ''realistic'' than the reality above it.', '2002-05-13 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60852, 1602, 189, '<td valign="top">Just a tad on the dark seid, but good.</td>', 'Just a tad on the dark seid, but good.', '2002-05-13 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60853, 1602, 509, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  The water reflection makes it look like you got a picture of the scene on both a calm and stormy day, nice job</td>', 'Very cool.  The water reflection makes it look like you got a picture of the scene on both a calm and stormy day, nice job', '2002-05-13 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60854, 1602, 1, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry, very well done.</td>', 'Great symmetry, very well done.', '2002-05-14 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60855, 1602, 824, '<td valign="top">This is probably the first reflection picture I saw. The interesting part of this one is the fact that it is hard to distinguish where the water starts, if that''s what is making the reflection. Nice Picture!</td>', 'This is probably the first reflection picture I saw. The interesting part of this one is the fact that it is hard to distinguish where the water starts, if that''s what is making the reflection. Nice Picture!', '2002-05-14 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60856, 1602, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, the clouds in the water appear surreal. (this is cool)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'Good photo, the clouds in the water appear surreal. (this is cool)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60857, 1602, 1037, '<td valign="top">The water reflection turned upside down idea works in one or two cases where turning it upside down created a new interpretation, but photos like this one could have been just left the right way up. It''s a nice photo other than that.</td>', 'The water reflection turned upside down idea works in one or two cases where turning it upside down created a new interpretation, but photos like this one could have been just left the right way up. It''s a nice photo other than that.', '2002-05-14 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60858, 1602, 107, '<td valign="top">done very nicely</td>', 'done very nicely', '2002-05-16 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60859, 1602, 259, '<td valign="top">one of the best reflection pictures</td>', 'one of the best reflection pictures', '2002-05-16 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60860, 1602, 675, '<td valign="top">really nice job, i can''t tell which side is up</td>', 'really nice job, i can''t tell which side is up', '2002-05-17 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60861, 1602, 878, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool</td>', 'Pretty cool', '2002-05-17 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60862, 1602, 47, '<td valign="top">you should have chopped down that tree on the right first.</td>', 'you should have chopped down that tree on the right first.', '2002-05-18 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60863, 1602, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is cool-- it''s hard for me to tell exactly which end is up.  The water must have been really still.   I wish the sky was a little more vivid in color.</td>', 'This is cool-- it''s hard for me to tell exactly which end is up.  The water must have been really still.   I wish the sky was a little more vivid in color.', '2002-05-19 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60864, 1603, 1379, '<td valign="top"><br/>The green suit is so striking!</td>', 'The green suit is so striking!', '2002-05-13 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60865, 1603, 327, '<td valign="top">On subject. Would only suggest more cropping.<br/>Good idea.</td>', 'On subject. Would only suggest more cropping.Good idea.', '2002-05-13 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60866, 1603, 772, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  A little closer view may have been nice too but I know that may have been impossible here...</td>', 'Cool shot!  A little closer view may have been nice too but I know that may have been impossible here...', '2002-05-13 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60867, 1603, 1599, '<td valign="top">VERY DIFFERENT. UPSIDE</td>', 'VERY DIFFERENT. UPSIDE', '2002-05-13 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60868, 1603, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice timing, background works well to show height.</td>', 'Nice timing, background works well to show height.', '2002-05-13 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60869, 1603, 1528, '<td valign="top">Like the off-centered<br/>might''ve put child more in focus<br/>great colors, wouldn''t have done it justice in Black n white i don''t think.<br/>Nice twist on child hanging upside down, far enough away from cliche.<br/>Good Job</td>', 'Like the off-centeredmight''ve put child more in focusgreat colors, wouldn''t have done it justice in Black n white i don''t think.Nice twist on child hanging upside down, far enough away from cliche.Good Job', '2002-05-14 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60870, 1603, 1070, '<td valign="top">just don''t like it ... sorry</td>', 'just don''t like it ... sorry', '2002-05-14 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60871, 1603, 1005, '<td valign="top">How high up?  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'How high up?  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60872, 1603, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks scary!</td>', 'Looks scary!', '2002-05-14 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60873, 1603, 675, '<td valign="top">could have been a lot cooler, although this must have taken a few tries to even get that shot.  next time take that wire off of the right hand side, and insert a commercial jet in the background, with the child reaching out for the jet</td>', 'could have been a lot cooler, although this must have taken a few tries to even get that shot.  next time take that wire off of the right hand side, and insert a commercial jet in the background, with the child reaching out for the jet', '2002-05-14 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60874, 1603, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is not only one of my favourite photos, but I think it has strong enough appeal on many levels to place in the challenge. Excellent work :)<br/><br/>If I''m wrong, then this site is crazy.</td>', 'This is not only one of my favourite photos, but I think it has strong enough appeal on many levels to place in the challenge. Excellent work :)If I''m wrong, then this site is crazy.', '2002-05-14 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60875, 1603, 1169, '<td valign="top">too much sky</td>', 'too much sky', '2002-05-15 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60876, 1603, 107, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen the person in the picture fill in the frame more, or perhaps a tighter crop.   Cropping this to a vertical picture might have given a bit more emphasis of height as well.</td>', 'I would have liked to seen the person in the picture fill in the frame more, or perhaps a tighter crop.   Cropping this to a vertical picture might have given a bit more emphasis of height as well.', '2002-05-15 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60877, 1603, 1636, '<td valign="top">Nice action Shot</td>', 'Nice action Shot', '2002-05-15 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60878, 1603, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Amazing subject.</td>', 'Neat.  Amazing subject.', '2002-05-16 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60879, 1603, 1446, '<td valign="top">I would have given you a 10 if you could have gotten that support line running right up the middle out of this shot.</td>', 'I would have given you a 10 if you could have gotten that support line running right up the middle out of this shot.', '2002-05-17 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60880, 1603, 2, '<td valign="top">Your framing is awesome on this shot.  I think the shot would be better in an environment where you digitally remove the line running through the middle, as I think it detracts from the movement of the image.  Still, very cool :)</td>', 'Your framing is awesome on this shot.  I think the shot would be better in an environment where you digitally remove the line running through the middle, as I think it detracts from the movement of the image.  Still, very cool :)', '2002-05-19 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60881, 1604, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colours here are so murky, it doesn''t really make the reflection pleasing to look at for me. The building itself is a good subject, just a shame the light wasn''t a bit sharper on the day, or something.</td>', 'The colours here are so murky, it doesn''t really make the reflection pleasing to look at for me. The building itself is a good subject, just a shame the light wasn''t a bit sharper on the day, or something.', '2002-05-13 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60882, 1604, 1024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.', '2002-05-13 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60883, 1604, 1455, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2002-05-13 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60884, 1604, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good comp, interesting, and 100% on the subject of the challenge.<br/>Great job.</td>', 'Very nice. Good comp, interesting, and 100% on the subject of the challenge.Great job.', '2002-05-13 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60885, 1604, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection shot!  This shot needs a little more contrast... it seems to be a little washed out in white... good job!</td>', 'Nice reflection shot!  This shot needs a little more contrast... it seems to be a little washed out in white... good job!', '2002-05-13 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60886, 1604, 472, '<td valign="top">reflection idea is a good one. i think i would have tried to crank the contrast up a lot more, though in your image editor.</td>', 'reflection idea is a good one. i think i would have tried to crank the contrast up a lot more, though in your image editor.', '2002-05-13 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
