(60888, 1604, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good thought.  Was the water murky?  It seems a little dark.  Photo 7 Creative 7 Upsidedown 7 total 7</td>', 'Good thought.  Was the water murky?  It seems a little dark.  Photo 7 Creative 7 Upsidedown 7 total 7', '2002-05-14 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
