(60892, 1604, 1078, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  If possible, I think I would have tried shooting this (or rotate/crop) so that the roofline was either much closer to being parallel to the image boundaries, or much further off.  Even though it''s a great reflection, the color of the water kind of muddies (no pun intended) the colors in the reflection.  Maybe if you tried adjusting the levels a little bit to make them a little stronger?  Finally, it looks like everything in the shot is reflection except that little bit up in the UR corner.  I think I woud have tried to crop that out and made it completely a reflection.</td>', 'Clever idea.  If possible, I think I would have tried shooting this (or rotate/crop) so that the roofline was either much closer to being parallel to the image boundaries, or much further off.  Even though it''s a great reflection, the color of the water kind of muddies (no pun intended) the colors in the reflection.  Maybe if you tried adjusting the levels a little bit to make them a little stronger?  Finally, it looks like everything in the shot is reflection except that little bit up in the UR corner.  I think I woud have tried to crop that out and made it completely a reflection.', '2002-05-15 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60893, 1604, 1191, '<td valign="top">A little of the foreground in the frame would have improved this picture, to my mind!!  Altogether a good photo.</td>', 'A little of the foreground in the frame would have improved this picture, to my mind!!  Altogether a good photo.', '2002-05-17 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60894, 1604, 1520, '<td valign="top">Colors are a little faded...maybe some increased saturation might''ve helped?  I think this would''ve looked really cool if you had dropped a pebble in the water near you to get some rings and then rotated the picture 180 degrees....would''ve looked like rings in the sky then.</td>', 'Colors are a little faded...maybe some increased saturation might''ve helped?  I think this would''ve looked really cool if you had dropped a pebble in the water near you to get some rings and then rotated the picture 180 degrees....would''ve looked like rings in the sky then.', '2002-05-19 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60895, 1604, 1, '<td valign="top">The murky water/run-down building work very well together, nicely done.</td>', 'The murky water/run-down building work very well together, nicely done.', '2002-05-19 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
