(60898, 1606, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna score this shot better than I normally would have but it''s a week late... This is a nice product shot but this week''s challenge is ''upside down'' and I don''t see any sign of upside down in this photo.  I really would have loved to vote on this shot in last week''s challenge.  This is very nice!  Score = 5 for nice presentation and everything else but I can''t do better than that in the current challenge... - REvisiting this photo I do believe I see the upside down :)  This is challenging to see but it''s upside down alright!!</td>', 'I''m gonna score this shot better than I normally would have but it''s a week late... This is a nice product shot but this week''s challenge is ''upside down'' and I don''t see any sign of upside down in this photo.  I really would have loved to vote on this shot in last week''s challenge.  This is very nice!  Score = 5 for nice presentation and everything else but I can''t do better than that in the current challenge... - REvisiting this photo I do believe I see the upside down :)  This is challenging to see but it''s upside down alright!!', '2002-05-13 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
