(60914, 1606, 1031, '<td valign="top">I saw something about (I think) this photo in the forums, so I wasn''t as caught by surprise as I might have been. I expect they''ll be asking you to show off your setup for this shot.</td>', 'I saw something about (I think) this photo in the forums, so I wasn''t as caught by surprise as I might have been. I expect they''ll be asking you to show off your setup for this shot.', '2002-05-14 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
