(60932, 1606, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the cream on the bottom!</td>', 'Nice effect with the cream on the bottom!', '2002-05-18 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60933, 1606, 811, '<td valign="top">Tricky, tricky, tricky.  Nice job, unfortunately, I''m afraid a lot of people won''t take the time to look closely at it and see that it is "upside down," or appears to be.  Nice color contrast and set-up.</td>', 'Tricky, tricky, tricky.  Nice job, unfortunately, I''m afraid a lot of people won''t take the time to look closely at it and see that it is "upside down," or appears to be.  Nice color contrast and set-up.', '2002-05-18 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60934, 1606, 741, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I just don''t get this one.  It may be a cultural thing (I''m in the UK and had to look up what Weinhradt Cream Soda is!) and if I was familiar with the product I''d spot what was upside down about it.  Still, very nicely photographed - the focusing could have done with being just a bit sharper (the orange swirly things look more blurred than necessary).  Looking forward to the explanation of this one.</td>', 'Sorry, but I just don''t get this one.  It may be a cultural thing (I''m in the UK and had to look up what Weinhradt Cream Soda is!) and if I was familiar with the product I''d spot what was upside down about it.  Still, very nicely photographed - the focusing could have done with being just a bit sharper (the orange swirly things look more blurred than necessary).  Looking forward to the explanation of this one.', '2002-05-19 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
