(60973, 1609, 772, '<td valign="top">This is great... I love it.. it''s one of my favorites this week... this photo has a nice ''mystery'' to it and I can''t say that I would do anything differently or change anything about it.... Excellent!! = 10</td>', 'This is great... I love it.. it''s one of my favorites this week... this photo has a nice ''mystery'' to it and I can''t say that I would do anything differently or change anything about it.... Excellent!! = 10', '2002-05-13 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60974, 1609, 1226, '<td valign="top">Haha very nice. Little bit-o cutting commentary never hurts either.</td>', 'Haha very nice. Little bit-o cutting commentary never hurts either.', '2002-05-13 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60975, 1609, 446, '<td valign="top">Soooo.... close.  Love the contrast of colors.  Works well together.  The lemons are the crowning touch in my opinion.  Extremely tough photo with the extreme dynamic range in the exposure.  Not sure how it could have been avoided, but I would have liked to have seen the exposure controlled on the bottom of the upper glass.  With this said, I still rate the shot very high.</td>', 'Soooo.... close.  Love the contrast of colors.  Works well together.  The lemons are the crowning touch in my opinion.  Extremely tough photo with the extreme dynamic range in the exposure.  Not sure how it could have been avoided, but I would have liked to have seen the exposure controlled on the bottom of the upper glass.  With this said, I still rate the shot very high.', '2002-05-13 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60976, 1609, 509, '<td valign="top">LOL, great use of props!  I can see you like Martha Stewart very much ; )</td>', 'LOL, great use of props!  I can see you like Martha Stewart very much ; )', '2002-05-13 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60977, 1609, 1031, '<td valign="top">Don''t let Martha get hold of those books -- she has enough power already!</td>', 'Don''t let Martha get hold of those books -- she has enough power already!', '2002-05-14 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60978, 1609, 543, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Nicely composed, and the exposure up front is good.  A lower angle might have let the rear candle flame show against the cloth, but would have complicated getting the wiccan whatnot to show.  I guess I just can''t see iced tea as belonging in this setting - maybe some dark red wine.  Overexposure in URHC detracts.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Nicely composed, and the exposure up front is good.  A lower angle might have let the rear candle flame show against the cloth, but would have complicated getting the wiccan whatnot to show.  I guess I just can''t see iced tea as belonging in this setting - maybe some dark red wine.  Overexposure in URHC detracts.', '2002-05-14 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60979, 1609, 1528, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition, subject matter (so far as the glasses) i like.<br/>Maybe a little too busy<br/></td>', 'Colors, composition, subject matter (so far as the glasses) i like.Maybe a little too busy', '2002-05-14 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
