(60986, 1609, 1135, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the witches book and knife. It there something about Martha that I don''t know?? Very nice photo, I like the lighting and color!</td>', 'I don''t get the witches book and knife. It there something about Martha that I don''t know?? Very nice photo, I like the lighting and color!', '2002-05-16 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60987, 1609, 748, '<td valign="top">Very creative, how you do dat?</td>', 'Very creative, how you do dat?', '2002-05-16 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60988, 1609, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the lemon on the bottom of the top glass (does that make sense? ;o), overall, I think the photo is just a tad too busy, especially with the background still very recognizable and the blown-out sky.</td>', 'I like the lemon on the bottom of the top glass (does that make sense? ;o), overall, I think the photo is just a tad too busy, especially with the background still very recognizable and the blown-out sky.', '2002-05-16 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60989, 1609, 1078, '<td valign="top">Not entirely certain I understand the title, but I like the photo.  The book on witchcraft is a nice addition.  I considered adding a glass of ice like this to my shot, but decided it was an unnecessary addition.  Glad to see someone did it though.  My only comment would be light levels.  I think this is a picture that begs to be dark and moody and that overexposed upper corner kind of takes away from that.  (Even if you disagree about the dark and moody, I think you would agree that it''s over-exposed.)  Maybe a few more plants to block off a little of that light?</td>', 'Not entirely certain I understand the title, but I like the photo.  The book on witchcraft is a nice addition.  I considered adding a glass of ice like this to my shot, but decided it was an unnecessary addition.  Glad to see someone did it though.  My only comment would be light levels.  I think this is a picture that begs to be dark and moody and that overexposed upper corner kind of takes away from that.  (Even if you disagree about the dark and moody, I think you would agree that it''s over-exposed.)  Maybe a few more plants to block off a little of that light?', '2002-05-16 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60990, 1609, 259, '<td valign="top">very cool, one of my favorites so far.  it has more to it than just the upside down factor to it.</td>', 'very cool, one of my favorites so far.  it has more to it than just the upside down factor to it.', '2002-05-16 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60991, 1609, 1446, '<td valign="top">Composition- IMO a little less stuff in this shot might have made it easier to isolate the subject.  It is creative, but its distracting to me.  Good use of ROT. Lots of texture.  Background- The plants are distracting to me as is the glare of light in the upper right hand corner. Technical- good focus again the upper right is bothering me.  The reflection of a person dressed in black in the glass is a wonderful touch. Overall Impression- Meets the challenge, I might have tried zooming in on the "subject" of this and used the other elements as a background.  Its obvious you put a lot of work into this shot.  Has some appeal on several levels.......6</td>', 'Composition- IMO a little less stuff in this shot might have made it easier to isolate the subject.  It is creative, but its distracting to me.  Good use of ROT. Lots of texture.  Background- The plants are distracting to me as is the glare of light in the upper right hand corner. Technical- good focus again the upper right is bothering me.  The reflection of a person dressed in black in the glass is a wonderful touch. Overall Impression- Meets the challenge, I might have tried zooming in on the "subject" of this and used the other elements as a background.  Its obvious you put a lot of work into this shot.  Has some appeal on several levels.......6', '2002-05-17 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60992, 1609, 1070, '<td valign="top">this one is a perfect shot.....lots of textures,colours<br/>and an amazingly magic glass</td>', 'this one is a perfect shot.....lots of textures,coloursand an amazingly magic glass', '2002-05-18 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(60993, 1609, 2, '<td valign="top">Very, very clever.  I love the lemon -- nice addition.</td>', 'Very, very clever.  I love the lemon -- nice addition.', '2002-05-19 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
