(61000, 1610, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because it looks real and spontaneous, rather than posed meticulously. I like that my eye is drawn to the girls'' ears, which for one thing are a really nice shade of pink, but also have a great rotational symmetry of their own. Hey, I''m a physics graduate, rotational symmetry does things to me I can''t describe :)</td>', 'I like this photo because it looks real and spontaneous, rather than posed meticulously. I like that my eye is drawn to the girls'' ears, which for one thing are a really nice shade of pink, but also have a great rotational symmetry of their own. Hey, I''m a physics graduate, rotational symmetry does things to me I can''t describe :)', '2002-05-13 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
