(61015, 1610, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice even lighting.  I wonder though, about cropping in even tighter. Addendum - on the cover of my newspaper this morning, there was a photo almost just like this, except the girls were facing each other and they weren''t twins.  And it was cropped tighter :)</td>', 'Nice even lighting.  I wonder though, about cropping in even tighter. Addendum - on the cover of my newspaper this morning, there was a photo almost just like this, except the girls were facing each other and they weren''t twins.  And it was cropped tighter :)', '2002-05-16 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
