(61060, 1614, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is a good photo, but it doesnt have much to do with the "upside down" theme.  granted, the photo''s upside down, but for no particular reason.  i dont think a horse is a good subject for this challenge.</td>', 'this is a good photo, but it doesnt have much to do with the "upside down" theme.  granted, the photo''s upside down, but for no particular reason.  i dont think a horse is a good subject for this challenge.', '2002-05-15 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61061, 1614, 1169, '<td valign="top">a horse is a horse of course of course</td>', 'a horse is a horse of course of course', '2002-05-17 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61062, 1614, 1078, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting, to my eye, normal subjects shot upside down pictures.  In order to "critique" it, I keep finding myself wanting to turn my head over and look at it.  :-)  Your white levels seem just a tad high -- that wall of the building in the background is really glowing -- but maybe you needed to do that to bring out the gloss on the horse''s coat.</td>', 'One of the more interesting, to my eye, normal subjects shot upside down pictures.  In order to "critique" it, I keep finding myself wanting to turn my head over and look at it.  :-)  Your white levels seem just a tad high -- that wall of the building in the background is really glowing -- but maybe you needed to do that to bring out the gloss on the horse''s coat.', '2002-05-17 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61063, 1614, 1512, '<td valign="top">A horse is a horse, of course of course!</td>', 'A horse is a horse, of course of course!', '2002-05-19 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61064, 1615, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a wrenchingly beautiful photograph. The only thing that gets me about it is the coyness of covering the nipples... it makes it seem self-conscious. The nipples themselves would add a great element to the outline of the breasts too... although I know that if they weren''t given some support, her breasts would fall towards her armpits (I know, I have a pair myself as I commented on the hooters girl photo in the last challenge :). Still, 10 from me.</td>', 'This is a wrenchingly beautiful photograph. The only thing that gets me about it is the coyness of covering the nipples... it makes it seem self-conscious. The nipples themselves would add a great element to the outline of the breasts too... although I know that if they weren''t given some support, her breasts would fall towards her armpits (I know, I have a pair myself as I commented on the hooters girl photo in the last challenge :). Still, 10 from me.', '2002-05-13 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61065, 1615, 1485, '<td valign="top">uh UH!! That looks right side up to me!   (I just hurt my neck trying to look at her face).   She''s beautiful.</td>', 'uh UH!! That looks right side up to me!   (I just hurt my neck trying to look at her face).   She''s beautiful.', '2002-05-13 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
