(61082, 1615, 772, '<td valign="top">This is very nice... The lighting is also excellent... The skin tone and smoothness of the lighting on the skin adds a lot to this photo.  I am wondering what this shot would look like if it were panned to the right a tad to capture more of the light, yet leaving the shadow on the left intact, but just less of it... excellent work!  Kudos to the model too :)</td>', 'This is very nice... The lighting is also excellent... The skin tone and smoothness of the lighting on the skin adds a lot to this photo.  I am wondering what this shot would look like if it were panned to the right a tad to capture more of the light, yet leaving the shadow on the left intact, but just less of it... excellent work!  Kudos to the model too :)', '2002-05-13 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
