(61118, 1616, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is creepy, making me imagine all kinds of threatening contexts. The worn fingers add to that. A more dramatic background could have made it even more ominous, but this just seems sunny and pleasant... maybe in a way that increases the tension because you imagine someone about to blow up some kids in a park or something...<br/><br/>In other words, it has a lot of impact.</td>', 'This photo is creepy, making me imagine all kinds of threatening contexts. The worn fingers add to that. A more dramatic background could have made it even more ominous, but this just seems sunny and pleasant... maybe in a way that increases the tension because you imagine someone about to blow up some kids in a park or something...In other words, it has a lot of impact.', '2002-05-13 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
