(61193, 1619, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you couldn''t do anything about it, but I would REALLY love this shot if that fence wasn''t in the background.  I also don''t know if you have a big enough image to do this with -- but I wonder how it would look if it were cropped vertically (in effect, cutting the left half of the image out of the picture).  That would let you get a little bit of a closer shot on the tortoise''s head.  (The more I look at it that way, the more I''d personally like it -- maybe I''ll talk to you baout getting a copy when the voting''s over.)  ;-)</td>', 'I''m guessing you couldn''t do anything about it, but I would REALLY love this shot if that fence wasn''t in the background.  I also don''t know if you have a big enough image to do this with -- but I wonder how it would look if it were cropped vertically (in effect, cutting the left half of the image out of the picture).  That would let you get a little bit of a closer shot on the tortoise''s head.  (The more I look at it that way, the more I''d personally like it -- maybe I''ll talk to you baout getting a copy when the voting''s over.)  ;-)', '2002-05-16 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
