(61196, 1619, 1707, '<td valign="top">Poor turtle!  I always feel so sorry for them in this position!  What a cruel joke Mother Nature played on turtles!  I rate this photograph a 9, but please be nice to the turtles from now on.  As for a critical comment, the horizon is a big off centered, not fully at the horizontal line. I suggest using a tripod.  -NBT</td>', 'Poor turtle!  I always feel so sorry for them in this position!  What a cruel joke Mother Nature played on turtles!  I rate this photograph a 9, but please be nice to the turtles from now on.  As for a critical comment, the horizon is a big off centered, not fully at the horizontal line. I suggest using a tripod.  -NBT', '2002-05-19 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
