(61288, 1623, 1078, '<td valign="top">Even though this is one of my high scorers, I wonder how other''s will vote it...  I don''t know that there''s anything I would change.  Nitpicky -- but maybe moving the board over to the left slightly to avoid that tiny bit of the doorway on the upper right side (?) being in the frame.</td>', 'Even though this is one of my high scorers, I wonder how other''s will vote it...  I don''t know that there''s anything I would change.  Nitpicky -- but maybe moving the board over to the left slightly to avoid that tiny bit of the doorway on the upper right side (?) being in the frame.', '2002-05-13 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
