(61290, 1623, 543, '<td valign="top">Good focus, and a mostly effective composition.  Probably more pop w/o the bit of house in the bg and with the colors a little more saturated.</td>', 'Good focus, and a mostly effective composition.  Probably more pop w/o the bit of house in the bg and with the colors a little more saturated.', '2002-05-14 05:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
