(61292, 1623, 1005, '<td valign="top">A prone foot at the edge of this photo would have "maxed" out this concept (and maybe some blood.)  Photo 8 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'A prone foot at the edge of this photo would have "maxed" out this concept (and maybe some blood.)  Photo 8 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61293, 1623, 312, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite shot this week, for some reason. the grittiness and texture of the wheel is great and the colors really pop. my only gripe is that i wish it had a little more depth of field to it. too much of the board is blurry. very nice shot, though.</td>', 'this is my favorite shot this week, for some reason. the grittiness and texture of the wheel is great and the colors really pop. my only gripe is that i wish it had a little more depth of field to it. too much of the board is blurry. very nice shot, though.', '2002-05-14 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61294, 1623, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Well composed, good focus.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Well composed, good focus.', '2002-05-16 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61295, 1623, 387, '<td valign="top">This a good composition and you did a great job with selective focus to draw attention to the wheel. Photo might have benefitted from a background such as a parking lot instead of a house to reinforce the ''skater'' implications. The exposure is good and lends to the grittiness. An added element such as a body laying in the background would have also added interest.</td>', 'This a good composition and you did a great job with selective focus to draw attention to the wheel. Photo might have benefitted from a background such as a parking lot instead of a house to reinforce the ''skater'' implications. The exposure is good and lends to the grittiness. An added element such as a body laying in the background would have also added interest.', '2002-05-17 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61296, 1623, 1696, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The colors look good on my monitor which is a triumph, and the detail on the wheel is nice. The title cracks me up, and is a nice addition to the picture.</td>', 'I really like this one. The colors look good on my monitor which is a triumph, and the detail on the wheel is nice. The title cracks me up, and is a nice addition to the picture.', '2002-05-18 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
