(61353, 1627, 472, '<td valign="top">this picture is incredible!  what imagination!  your choice of a model with tremendous character is great.  i also like the way you filled the foreground with the calculator.</td>', 'this picture is incredible!  what imagination!  your choice of a model with tremendous character is great.  i also like the way you filled the foreground with the calculator.', '2002-05-13 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61354, 1627, 327, '<td valign="top">Aren''t you the smart one. I did think of this but couldn''t think how to do it. Good idea, creative. Nice!!!</td>', 'Aren''t you the smart one. I did think of this but couldn''t think how to do it. Good idea, creative. Nice!!!', '2002-05-13 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61355, 1627, 1, '<td valign="top">Such a snapshot, but the picture just makes you smile.  The idea, brilliant, the model looks like he''s laughin, which in turn made me giggle a bit myself.  As for technicalities, a larger f-stop to get the calculate and model in focus.</td>', 'Such a snapshot, but the picture just makes you smile.  The idea, brilliant, the model looks like he''s laughin, which in turn made me giggle a bit myself.  As for technicalities, a larger f-stop to get the calculate and model in focus.', '2002-05-13 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61356, 1627, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  I love it... The grin on the face is just awesome...  i would like to have seen a little more focus on the calculator, and I''m glad you chose HELLO instead of BOOB, BOOBIE, or BOOBLESS!!!  Good Job!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  I love it... The grin on the face is just awesome...  i would like to have seen a little more focus on the calculator, and I''m glad you chose HELLO instead of BOOB, BOOBIE, or BOOBLESS!!!  Good Job!', '2002-05-13 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61357, 1627, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its a good picture that needs a little bit of work.  First of all I''d start by focusing on the calculator since you have the "hello" message there and the topic is upside down, this is your subject afterall.  The next thing would be to get out of wherever you were and put your model and the subject in a differnt enviornment that isn''t so distracting.  The background at the right side of the picture detracts from the picture.</td>', 'Its a good picture that needs a little bit of work.  First of all I''d start by focusing on the calculator since you have the "hello" message there and the topic is upside down, this is your subject afterall.  The next thing would be to get out of wherever you were and put your model and the subject in a differnt enviornment that isn''t so distracting.  The background at the right side of the picture detracts from the picture.', '2002-05-13 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61358, 1627, 741, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-05-13 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61359, 1627, 570, '<td valign="top">need to focus on the calculator</td>', 'need to focus on the calculator', '2002-05-13 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61360, 1627, 1128, '<td valign="top">Oh, I really really like this idea.  Love the expression on the person''s face too.  It would be perfection if it was a little more in focus.  I remember doing this.  You can also write "BOOBLESS" and "BOOBS" if you want!   :)</td>', 'Oh, I really really like this idea.  Love the expression on the person''s face too.  It would be perfection if it was a little more in focus.  I remember doing this.  You can also write "BOOBLESS" and "BOOBS" if you want!   :)', '2002-05-13 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61361, 1627, 671, '<td valign="top">Good subject, great sense of humor! Nice framing.  Too much glare on the calculator.</td>', 'Good subject, great sense of humor! Nice framing.  Too much glare on the calculator.', '2002-05-13 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
