(61378, 1627, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on his face.  He makes it looks totally spontaneous.  However, the blurriness of the calculator, and the clarity of the boy seems to make me focus more on him than the message.  Did you use a flash?  If so, could you have cut it off?  That may have kept the white keys from washing out.</td>', 'I love the expression on his face.  He makes it looks totally spontaneous.  However, the blurriness of the calculator, and the clarity of the boy seems to make me focus more on him than the message.  Did you use a flash?  If so, could you have cut it off?  That may have kept the white keys from washing out.', '2002-05-18 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
