(61394, 1628, 1135, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in the photo. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the lighting in the photo. Nice job!', '2002-05-16 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61395, 1628, 1169, '<td valign="top">the shadow is nice</td>', 'the shadow is nice', '2002-05-17 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61396, 1628, 1, '<td valign="top">Such a bland subject, but somehow it looks really nice.  The shadow that the bottom of the glass produces is great, as are the soft colors.</td>', 'Such a bland subject, but somehow it looks really nice.  The shadow that the bottom of the glass produces is great, as are the soft colors.', '2002-05-19 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61397, 1629, 835, '<td valign="top">looks grainy</td>', 'looks grainy', '2002-05-13 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61398, 1629, 327, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, good work. On the spot with the topic.<br/>Only nit would be it''s dark and a little tilted.</td>', 'Clever idea, good work. On the spot with the topic.Only nit would be it''s dark and a little tilted.', '2002-05-13 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61399, 1629, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  It looks like your zoom may have made this photo a little grainy.  I have found that zooming into the digital zoom range causes this to happen sometimes.</td>', 'Nice shot!  It looks like your zoom may have made this photo a little grainy.  I have found that zooming into the digital zoom range causes this to happen sometimes.', '2002-05-13 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61400, 1629, 671, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  Good choice of backdrop.  Good focus for such small birds.  VERY appropriate for topic!</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  Good choice of backdrop.  Good focus for such small birds.  VERY appropriate for topic!', '2002-05-13 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61401, 1629, 472, '<td valign="top">boy they can cling onto anything can''t they?</td>', 'boy they can cling onto anything can''t they?', '2002-05-13 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61402, 1629, 1599, '<td valign="top">OK I LIKE YOUR INSITE</td>', 'OK I LIKE YOUR INSITE', '2002-05-13 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61403, 1629, 1, '<td valign="top">Great catch, but there doesn''t seem to be enough light.  It''s a little grainy too.</td>', 'Great catch, but there doesn''t seem to be enough light.  It''s a little grainy too.', '2002-05-13 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61404, 1629, 1528, '<td valign="top">I like the subject(s).<br/>Is there lack of Camera quality or is it lack of  lighting here?<br/>The slight tilt to the left and the light or whatever it is on the left edge near the bottom are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the subject(s).Is there lack of Camera quality or is it lack of  lighting here?The slight tilt to the left and the light or whatever it is on the left edge near the bottom are a bit distracting.', '2002-05-14 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61405, 1629, 1005, '<td valign="top">Finches are great subjects, I love ''em!  Appears grainy.....low end camera?  Photo 4 Creative 5 Upsidedown 7 total 5</td>', 'Finches are great subjects, I love ''em!  Appears grainy.....low end camera?  Photo 4 Creative 5 Upsidedown 7 total 5', '2002-05-14 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61406, 1629, 885, '<td valign="top">Weirdly noisy.  I think maybe straightening the pole and either centering it or moving it more off-center would help.  I like the repetition though, of the one bird in the light and the second one lower in the same position but shadowed.</td>', 'Weirdly noisy.  I think maybe straightening the pole and either centering it or moving it more off-center would help.  I like the repetition though, of the one bird in the light and the second one lower in the same position but shadowed.', '2002-05-14 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61407, 1629, 917, '<td valign="top">Ive been trying to get that close to feeding birds for ages.</td>', 'Ive been trying to get that close to feeding birds for ages.', '2002-05-15 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61408, 1629, 878, '<td valign="top">Dark and grainy shot.</td>', 'Dark and grainy shot.', '2002-05-15 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61409, 1629, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  :-)  I started to comment that a slightly straighter camera orientation would be nice.  Then I realized it probably was fairly straight, but since the birds were all on one side of the feeder, it''s hanging crooked.  The low-light noise mars the picture -- probably not a lot you can do about that because I''m guessing this was an early morning/late evening photo.  I think I might have cropped this a little tighter so that there''s an even margin between bird and border at top and bottom.  Also, maybe using the 640x427 image size to accentuate the very thin vertical nature of the shot.</td>', 'Nice title.  :-)  I started to comment that a slightly straighter camera orientation would be nice.  Then I realized it probably was fairly straight, but since the birds were all on one side of the feeder, it''s hanging crooked.  The low-light noise mars the picture -- probably not a lot you can do about that because I''m guessing this was an early morning/late evening photo.  I think I might have cropped this a little tighter so that there''s an even margin between bird and border at top and bottom.  Also, maybe using the 640x427 image size to accentuate the very thin vertical nature of the shot.', '2002-05-15 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61410, 1629, 107, '<td valign="top">I''m getting a lot of noise from this picture.. like it could have been a bit crisper.  It''s a really good idea though.</td>', 'I''m getting a lot of noise from this picture.. like it could have been a bit crisper.  It''s a really good idea though.', '2002-05-16 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61411, 1629, 875, '<td valign="top">The subject is very cute.  You were lucky to get them all in position!  The photo is a little noisy.</td>', 'The subject is very cute.  You were lucky to get them all in position!  The photo is a little noisy.', '2002-05-17 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61412, 1629, 1707, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Try using Photoshop Elements or some other program to lighten up it up. -NBT</td>', 'Too dark.  Try using Photoshop Elements or some other program to lighten up it up. -NBT', '2002-05-19 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61413, 1630, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, very inviting tummy to scratch.</td>', 'Hehe, very inviting tummy to scratch.', '2002-05-13 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61414, 1630, 1379, '<td valign="top">Aww, she''s so fuzzy!  Lookit the little LEGS!</td>', 'Aww, she''s so fuzzy!  Lookit the little LEGS!', '2002-05-13 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61415, 1630, 1, '<td valign="top">I''m a little confused as to what exactly I''m looking at here.</td>', 'I''m a little confused as to what exactly I''m looking at here.', '2002-05-13 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61416, 1630, 1128, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2002-05-13 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61417, 1630, 327, '<td valign="top">Dang wish my legs looked that good in either direction!!<br/>Cute idea here.</td>', 'Dang wish my legs looked that good in either direction!!Cute idea here.', '2002-05-13 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61418, 1630, 772, '<td valign="top">A little more of the cat in the photo would have been nice :)</td>', 'A little more of the cat in the photo would have been nice :)', '2002-05-13 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61419, 1630, 1574, '<td valign="top">Well whatever it is<br/>It''s upsidedown<br/>That''s for sure</td>', 'Well whatever it isIt''s upsidedownThat''s for sure', '2002-05-13 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61420, 1630, 1599, '<td valign="top">VERY HAIRY LEGS, NEED TO SHAVE</td>', 'VERY HAIRY LEGS, NEED TO SHAVE', '2002-05-13 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61421, 1630, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is different.  It feels a little too cluttered for me.  There''s the afghan (?) on the left, the black and red something in UR, and the stripes along the top all competing for the main focus of the cat and the magazine.  (I assume it''s a cat anyway...)  A little more simple setting would have been better for my taste.</td>', 'This is different.  It feels a little too cluttered for me.  There''s the afghan (?) on the left, the black and red something in UR, and the stripes along the top all competing for the main focus of the cat and the magazine.  (I assume it''s a cat anyway...)  A little more simple setting would have been better for my taste.', '2002-05-13 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61422, 1630, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny concept!  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 9 total 9</td>', 'Funny concept!  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 9 total 9', '2002-05-14 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61423, 1630, 675, '<td valign="top">too busy here, can''t really tell what yer point is</td>', 'too busy here, can''t really tell what yer point is', '2002-05-14 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
