(61425, 1630, 472, '<td valign="top">so what can i say, my photo sucked.  who cares.  it''s a timely moment, caught perfectly : )</td>', 'so what can i say, my photo sucked.  who cares.  it''s a timely moment, caught perfectly : )', '2002-05-20 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(61426, 1632, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice spot and nice shot. Very good work.</td>', 'Nice spot and nice shot. Very good work.', '2002-05-13 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61427, 1632, 616, '<td valign="top">the image of the trees in the lake is a bit darkish</td>', 'the image of the trees in the lake is a bit darkish', '2002-05-13 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61428, 1632, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite of the reflection images... the items hanging from the top of the frame are slightly distracting, but otherwise, a good photo!  nice job...</td>', 'I think this is my favorite of the reflection images... the items hanging from the top of the frame are slightly distracting, but otherwise, a good photo!  nice job...', '2002-05-13 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61429, 1632, 1024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and very peaceful.</td>', 'Beautiful and very peaceful.', '2002-05-13 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61430, 1632, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beauty!  I love the blue in the water.  It''s so rich and vivid.</td>', 'Beauty!  I love the blue in the water.  It''s so rich and vivid.', '2002-05-13 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61431, 1632, 1175, '<td valign="top">Try using rule of thirds.  Instead of cutting this right in half put your horizon on the top third so that we can see more of your subject, the "Mirror Image"</td>', 'Try using rule of thirds.  Instead of cutting this right in half put your horizon on the top third so that we can see more of your subject, the "Mirror Image"', '2002-05-13 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61432, 1632, 737, '<td valign="top">One of the best reflections</td>', 'One of the best reflections', '2002-05-13 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61433, 1632, 1599, '<td valign="top">i think a lot of people lost the challange some where. not you though</td>', 'i think a lot of people lost the challange some where. not you though', '2002-05-13 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61434, 1632, 1, '<td valign="top">Great reflection.  I think a tighter crop is needed thouh.</td>', 'Great reflection.  I think a tighter crop is needed thouh.', '2002-05-13 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61435, 1632, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Low contrast subject(s) reduce the effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8<br/>The best reflection so far had sparcer subject matter, only shot the water, closer up and had nice items of interest in the water.<br/>I like the stump.  Could you have obtained a higher vantage point?  (shot  more downwards, centering on the stump)</td>', 'Nice photo.  Low contrast subject(s) reduce the effect.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Upsidedown 8 total 8The best reflection so far had sparcer subject matter, only shot the water, closer up and had nice items of interest in the water.I like the stump.  Could you have obtained a higher vantage point?  (shot  more downwards, centering on the stump)', '2002-05-14 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61436, 1632, 1323, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week.  How''d the little branch at the top sneak in there?</td>', 'One of my favorites this week.  How''d the little branch at the top sneak in there?', '2002-05-14 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61437, 1632, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat scene.  The stray branch at the top kind of distracts...I think if you could have, focusing in on the tree trunks reflected in the water to the right would have made it a stronger image.</td>', 'Neat scene.  The stray branch at the top kind of distracts...I think if you could have, focusing in on the tree trunks reflected in the water to the right would have made it a stronger image.', '2002-05-16 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61438, 1632, 875, '<td valign="top">The reflections are beautiful, but the photo feels like it slopes a little bit to the right.</td>', 'The reflections are beautiful, but the photo feels like it slopes a little bit to the right.', '2002-05-17 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61439, 1632, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The colors of the lake/tree/sky is very nice, and it looks so peaceful and serene.  I know someone has probably mentioned the leaves and twig at the top, so I won''t. :-)  If it had been possible to position yourself so that the diagonal piece of land in the lower left was more prominent, that may have given the picture a little more "direction."  It didn''t affect the score because I fully realize that may not have been possible, but it might be something to consider.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The colors of the lake/tree/sky is very nice, and it looks so peaceful and serene.  I know someone has probably mentioned the leaves and twig at the top, so I won''t. :-)  If it had been possible to position yourself so that the diagonal piece of land in the lower left was more prominent, that may have given the picture a little more "direction."  It didn''t affect the score because I fully realize that may not have been possible, but it might be something to consider.', '2002-05-18 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61440, 1632, 671, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments.  It has been quite helpful to get feedback.  The little twig at the top I left in on purpose for the effect of peering out from the trees, but I see it was more distracting, rather than setting the mood.  I also liked the other suggestions on cropping and framing.  I''m going to try the suggestion about the "thirds".</td>', 'Thank you for your comments.  It has been quite helpful to get feedback.  The little twig at the top I left in on purpose for the effect of peering out from the trees, but I see it was more distracting, rather than setting the mood.  I also liked the other suggestions on cropping and framing.  I''m going to try the suggestion about the "thirds".', '2002-05-20 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(61441, 1632, 139, '<td valign="top">I think the twig would have been good, except that it complemented the dip in the line of trees a bit too well.</td>', 'I think the twig would have been good, except that it complemented the dip in the line of trees a bit too well.', '2002-05-27 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(61442, 1633, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the clarity of the bee. Nice idea and perspective too.</td>', 'I like the colors and the clarity of the bee. Nice idea and perspective too.', '2002-05-13 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(61443, 1633, 92, '<td valign="top">If this had been a macro shot of that flower and bee it would be a 10. There''s just a little too much distraction with all the area around the bee. I didn''t see him at first. Once I did...I thought wow this would be a 10 if just focused on the bee and the rest not all around it. Still a good capture and great idea !</td>', 'If this had been a macro shot of that flower and bee it would be a 10. There''s just a little too much distraction with all the area around the bee. I didn''t see him at first. Once I did...I thought wow this would be a 10 if just focused on the bee and the rest not all around it. Still a good capture and great idea !', '2002-05-13 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61444, 1633, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this photograph.</td>', 'Wow, I love this photograph.', '2002-05-13 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61445, 1633, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot!  If the bee had been a larger part of the image, some more visual impact would have been provided.  If you are using a relatively high resolution camera, you may have been able to get a crop out of this specific area of the photo that would have enhanced the ''upside down'' aspect of this photo.  Good work!</td>', 'This is a nice shot!  If the bee had been a larger part of the image, some more visual impact would have been provided.  If you are using a relatively high resolution camera, you may have been able to get a crop out of this specific area of the photo that would have enhanced the ''upside down'' aspect of this photo.  Good work!', '2002-05-13 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61446, 1633, 1037, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to find the bee. It''s gorgeous though :). Are these orchids? I love the camera angle.</td>', 'It took me a while to find the bee. It''s gorgeous though :). Are these orchids? I love the camera angle.', '2002-05-13 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61447, 1633, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice bee and lovely iris. Good color.</td>', 'Nice bee and lovely iris. Good color.', '2002-05-13 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61448, 1633, 1599, '<td valign="top">the challenge is upside down   RIGHT?</td>', 'the challenge is upside down   RIGHT?', '2002-05-13 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61449, 1633, 1528, '<td valign="top">I like it.<br/>The image is too dark though, and I had to search for you subject matter (aka the bee).<br/>Nice angles and framing  and great focus.</td>', 'I like it.The image is too dark though, and I had to search for you subject matter (aka the bee).Nice angles and framing  and great focus.', '2002-05-14 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61450, 1633, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice bee shot.  (Bee''s are surprisingly hard shots, busy, busy....)  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 9</td>', 'Nice bee shot.  (Bee''s are surprisingly hard shots, busy, busy....)  Photo 9 Creativity 9 Upsidedown 8 total 9', '2002-05-14 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61451, 1633, 675, '<td valign="top">this is the best you could do?</td>', 'this is the best you could do?', '2002-05-14 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61452, 1633, 1169, '<td valign="top">i think more cropping and putting attention on the bee would''ve been better, still a nice shot</td>', 'i think more cropping and putting attention on the bee would''ve been better, still a nice shot', '2002-05-15 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61453, 1633, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I had trouble finding the subject of the photo. Maybe a different crop would help.</td>', 'Nice shot but I had trouble finding the subject of the photo. Maybe a different crop would help.', '2002-05-16 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61454, 1633, 107, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty image...and it took me a few seconds to notice the bee on the flower.  very subtle, but very well done.</td>', 'This is a very pretty image...and it took me a few seconds to notice the bee on the flower.  very subtle, but very well done.', '2002-05-17 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61455, 1633, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!</td>', 'Great action shot!', '2002-05-19 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61456, 1633, 1, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop of the bee would''ve drawn me into the subject better.  I had to hunt for him.</td>', 'A tighter crop of the bee would''ve drawn me into the subject better.  I had to hunt for him.', '2002-05-19 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61457, 1635, 327, '<td valign="top">You on topic for the challenge.<br/>Nice work..good water color.</td>', 'You on topic for the challenge.Nice work..good water color.', '2002-05-13 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61458, 1635, 772, '<td valign="top">My pool isn''t even open yet.. i wish they would hurry up!!!  good shot!</td>', 'My pool isn''t even open yet.. i wish they would hurry up!!!  good shot!', '2002-05-13 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61459, 1635, 1599, '<td valign="top">WAS THIS TAKEN THIS WEEK?  THIS IS NOT REALLY REFLECTING UPSIDE DOWN?</td>', 'WAS THIS TAKEN THIS WEEK?  THIS IS NOT REALLY REFLECTING UPSIDE DOWN?', '2002-05-13 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61460, 1635, 472, '<td valign="top">ahh that water looks inviting.  i also want to tickle those feet!</td>', 'ahh that water looks inviting.  i also want to tickle those feet!', '2002-05-14 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61461, 1635, 1005, '<td valign="top">Summer fun (not for me, yet)!  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8</td>', 'Summer fun (not for me, yet)!  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 8', '2002-05-14 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61462, 1635, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really love the composition and framing of this picture. It''s gorgeous :) Especially with the water drops suspended in the air.</td>', 'I really love the composition and framing of this picture. It''s gorgeous :) Especially with the water drops suspended in the air.', '2002-05-15 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61463, 1635, 1070, '<td valign="top">god idea</td>', 'god idea', '2002-05-17 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
