(61573, 1645, 543, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Very well composed.  Nicely sharp.  Almost very well lit.  So much promise, and then a rubber frog...</td>', 'Great colors.  Very well composed.  Nicely sharp.  Almost very well lit.  So much promise, and then a rubber frog...', '2002-05-14 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61574, 1645, 472, '<td valign="top">oh my, what a pretty image.  very high quality.  is that sunlight?</td>', 'oh my, what a pretty image.  very high quality.  is that sunlight?', '2002-05-14 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61575, 1645, 1528, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the shadows!!!!!!!!<br/></td>', 'Love the colors and the shadows!!!!!!!!', '2002-05-14 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61576, 1645, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice plastic frog.  (live in a big city?)  Try playing with the depth of field.  Photo 7 Creative 7 Upsidedown 6 total 7</td>', 'Nice plastic frog.  (live in a big city?)  Try playing with the depth of field.  Photo 7 Creative 7 Upsidedown 6 total 7', '2002-05-14 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61577, 1645, 656, '<td valign="top">cool colours</td>', 'cool colours', '2002-05-14 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61578, 1645, 748, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2002-05-14 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61579, 1645, 1078, '<td valign="top">The plant reminds me of something we used to have at home that I think was an asparagus fern.  But that''s beside the point.  A little bit of glare on the frog''s back that I only find distracting because it''s right in the middle of the black streak.  Loads of different ways that can be softened.  The other side of the frog is a little dark.  I would have maybe bounced a little light in there -- but that''s a personal pref.  there''s that yellow stick/branch in the LR I find to be a little out of place since the rest of the plant looks so healthy.  Nice shot.</td>', 'The plant reminds me of something we used to have at home that I think was an asparagus fern.  But that''s beside the point.  A little bit of glare on the frog''s back that I only find distracting because it''s right in the middle of the black streak.  Loads of different ways that can be softened.  The other side of the frog is a little dark.  I would have maybe bounced a little light in there -- but that''s a personal pref.  there''s that yellow stick/branch in the LR I find to be a little out of place since the rest of the plant looks so healthy.  Nice shot.', '2002-05-15 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61580, 1645, 886, '<td valign="top">Could be a 3D-rendering!</td>', 'Could be a 3D-rendering!', '2002-05-16 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61581, 1645, 1336, '<td valign="top">stunning colors.  great photo.</td>', 'stunning colors.  great photo.', '2002-05-16 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61582, 1645, 885, '<td valign="top">Is that plastic?  I like the background and the lighting is nice.</td>', 'Is that plastic?  I like the background and the lighting is nice.', '2002-05-16 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61583, 1645, 259, '<td valign="top">wow, this is an excellent photo.  the frog is so fake looking if it is truely real.</td>', 'wow, this is an excellent photo.  the frog is so fake looking if it is truely real.', '2002-05-16 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61584, 1645, 675, '<td valign="top">nice work, you really captured something great here</td>', 'nice work, you really captured something great here', '2002-05-17 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61585, 1645, 889, '<td valign="top">This is a four fingered forest frog (plastic). Interesting shot idea I can see it is really upside down.<br/>Otherwise, why else would you have wedged the upper foot the way you did. Its a preatty good macro shot.</td>', 'This is a four fingered forest frog (plastic). Interesting shot idea I can see it is really upside down.Otherwise, why else would you have wedged the upper foot the way you did. Its a preatty good macro shot.', '2002-05-17 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61586, 1645, 875, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, especially in the background, but the photo has a lot of noise.</td>', 'Nice colors, especially in the background, but the photo has a lot of noise.', '2002-05-17 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61587, 1645, 1070, '<td valign="top">nice colours</td>', 'nice colours', '2002-05-18 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61588, 1645, 2, '<td valign="top">I thought this was rendered at first, until I remembered collecting those frogs from the quarter machines in the grocery store.  My favorite part of the image is the fading background and how that''s used to really make the green plants pop out!</td>', 'I thought this was rendered at first, until I remembered collecting those frogs from the quarter machines in the grocery store.  My favorite part of the image is the fading background and how that''s used to really make the green plants pop out!', '2002-05-19 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61589, 1647, 1037, '<td valign="top">People came up with some gorgeous black and white shots for this challenge, this being one of them :). The shadows on the wall, the highlights in the glasses, the shapes of the glasses and stems all gel really well for me, and black and white enhances it considerably. I feel like I''m giving out too many 10s, but here goes another one!</td>', 'People came up with some gorgeous black and white shots for this challenge, this being one of them :). The shadows on the wall, the highlights in the glasses, the shapes of the glasses and stems all gel really well for me, and black and white enhances it considerably. I feel like I''m giving out too many 10s, but here goes another one!', '2002-05-13 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61590, 1647, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative, clear, sharp and on topic for the challenge.<br/>Well done, good work here. Nice!!!</td>', 'Creative, clear, sharp and on topic for the challenge.Well done, good work here. Nice!!!', '2002-05-13 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61591, 1647, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot here... I like the lighting and the composure... good job!</td>', 'Excellent shot here... I like the lighting and the composure... good job!', '2002-05-13 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61592, 1647, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white</td>', 'Nice use of black and white', '2002-05-13 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61593, 1647, 330, '<td valign="top">Great technique but not all that creative and imaginative.</td>', 'Great technique but not all that creative and imaginative.', '2002-05-13 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61594, 1647, 1379, '<td valign="top">An army of glasses...  I love all the catchlights.</td>', 'An army of glasses...  I love all the catchlights.', '2002-05-13 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61595, 1647, 1128, '<td valign="top">I think B&amp; W was a good call.  I''m glad it''s off center.  Nice.</td>', 'I think B& W was a good call.  I''m glad it''s off center.  Nice.', '2002-05-13 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61596, 1647, 641, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot..The lighting and composition are great.</td>', 'Beautiful shot..The lighting and composition are great.', '2002-05-13 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61597, 1647, 472, '<td valign="top">sweeet ... this is like soo classicly cool</td>', 'sweeet ... this is like soo classicly cool', '2002-05-13 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61598, 1647, 1457, '<td valign="top">i like the shot, but I think more controlled lighting would have helped</td>', 'i like the shot, but I think more controlled lighting would have helped', '2002-05-13 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61599, 1647, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the cropping here, but it definitely has a style of its own</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the cropping here, but it definitely has a style of its own', '2002-05-13 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61600, 1647, 1528, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love the shadows, the angles.........and contrast!<br/>Sort of feel like its cropped too much on top, would''ve like seeing at least part of the bottoms, but maybe that didn''t work in the shot setup.<br/>Good Job!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love the shadows, the angles.........and contrast!Sort of feel like its cropped too much on top, would''ve like seeing at least part of the bottoms, but maybe that didn''t work in the shot setup.Good Job!', '2002-05-13 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61601, 1647, 142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2002-05-14 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61602, 1647, 1005, '<td valign="top">Excite me, please.  Photo 9 Creativity 5 Upsidedown 7 total 7</td>', 'Excite me, please.  Photo 9 Creativity 5 Upsidedown 7 total 7', '2002-05-15 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61603, 1647, 919, '<td valign="top">I do very much like this type of picture although it is not a "decoration" picture, more a technical shot and one that is quite difficult to achieve. Outside reflections creep in. If is a picture to be technically proud of.</td>', 'I do very much like this type of picture although it is not a "decoration" picture, more a technical shot and one that is quite difficult to achieve. Outside reflections creep in. If is a picture to be technically proud of.', '2002-05-15 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61604, 1647, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a nice simple composition, b&amp;w works very well here.</td>', 'What a nice simple composition, b&w works very well here.', '2002-05-16 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61605, 1647, 675, '<td valign="top">technically sound photo in my opinion, but i''m just not interested</td>', 'technically sound photo in my opinion, but i''m just not interested', '2002-05-17 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61606, 1647, 1078, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite no what to say about this one.  I like the look of the glasses -- given the title, I don''t know if there''s actually water sprayed up in them, or if the weird reflections are cellophane, or if that''s just the way the glasses look.  The only thing I really have to suggest might be trying a vertical composition instead of horizontal.</td>', 'I don''t quite no what to say about this one.  I like the look of the glasses -- given the title, I don''t know if there''s actually water sprayed up in them, or if the weird reflections are cellophane, or if that''s just the way the glasses look.  The only thing I really have to suggest might be trying a vertical composition instead of horizontal.', '2002-05-19 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61607, 1647, 332, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more contrast.<br/>//arnit.hamstur.is/arni/more_contrast.jpg</td>', 'I would like to see more contrast.//arnit.hamstur.is/arni/more_contrast.jpg', '2002-05-19 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61608, 1647, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup, the reflections are great, however; I don''t like the dead space on the left</td>', 'Nicely setup, the reflections are great, however; I don''t like the dead space on the left', '2002-05-19 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61609, 1647, 885, '<td valign="top">Woohoo, I got no ones.  This is actually quite drastically cropped from a larger picture which included the entire glasses.  I wanted to emphasize what I thought was the most interesting part of the photo - the reflections that the glasses made on each other and the shadows on the matboard I was holding up next to them.  I had a vertical composition, but liked this better as it seemed a bit more unique.  I''m surprised that no one commented on the missing glass, or on the fact that the perspective really is off for a photograph.  The title referred to the fact that I thought that the reflections looked like ripples on water.</td>', 'Woohoo, I got no ones.  This is actually quite drastically cropped from a larger picture which included the entire glasses.  I wanted to emphasize what I thought was the most interesting part of the photo - the reflections that the glasses made on each other and the shadows on the matboard I was holding up next to them.  I had a vertical composition, but liked this better as it seemed a bit more unique.  I''m surprised that no one commented on the missing glass, or on the fact that the perspective really is off for a photograph.  The title referred to the fact that I thought that the reflections looked like ripples on water.', '2002-05-20 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(61610, 1648, 327, '<td valign="top">Oh so clever. Creative work and a good photo too. Nice work. Congrat!!</td>', 'Oh so clever. Creative work and a good photo too. Nice work. Congrat!!', '2002-05-13 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61611, 1648, 570, '<td valign="top">really good, too bad the plant isn''t upside down though.</td>', 'really good, too bad the plant isn''t upside down though.', '2002-05-13 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61612, 1648, 47, '<td valign="top">haw</td>', 'haw', '2002-05-13 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61613, 1648, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life shot here... I like your interpretation of this challenge :)</td>', 'Very nice still life shot here... I like your interpretation of this challenge :)', '2002-05-13 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61614, 1648, 472, '<td valign="top">hey you better put everything back the way it was, ok?</td>', 'hey you better put everything back the way it was, ok?', '2002-05-13 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61615, 1648, 1599, '<td valign="top">the challenge is upside down   RIGHT?    everything should be upside down</td>', 'the challenge is upside down   RIGHT?    everything should be upside down', '2002-05-13 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61616, 1648, 737, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement. Must have take some time to set up. Congratulations.</td>', 'Great arrangement. Must have take some time to set up. Congratulations.', '2002-05-13 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61617, 1648, 1, '<td valign="top">You should''ve glued them all to the top of the shelves. :)  Cute idea, but the plant/bird thing/book stopper with the thinking man are right side up!</td>', 'You should''ve glued them all to the top of the shelves. :)  Cute idea, but the plant/bird thing/book stopper with the thinking man are right side up!', '2002-05-13 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61618, 1648, 1528, '<td valign="top">Creative subject idea.<br/>Lighting seems a little uneven.<br/>Nice shot though.</td>', 'Creative subject idea.Lighting seems a little uneven.Nice shot though.', '2002-05-13 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61619, 1648, 1005, '<td valign="top">What one quail and plant aren''t upsidedown?  Good shot!  Photo 8 Creative 8 Upsidedown 8  total 8</td>', 'What one quail and plant aren''t upsidedown?  Good shot!  Photo 8 Creative 8 Upsidedown 8  total 8', '2002-05-14 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61620, 1648, 318, '<td valign="top">That was quite clever, exept for that plant. :)</td>', 'That was quite clever, exept for that plant. :)', '2002-05-14 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61621, 1648, 1031, '<td valign="top">Is one of those paintings a reflections scene?</td>', 'Is one of those paintings a reflections scene?', '2002-05-15 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61622, 1648, 1360, '<td valign="top">I love how you set this shot up!</td>', 'I love how you set this shot up!', '2002-05-15 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61623, 1648, 1070, '<td valign="top">why didn''t you turn the plant upside down ???<br/>looks very odd ... but a nice original idea</td>', 'why didn''t you turn the plant upside down ???looks very odd ... but a nice original idea', '2002-05-15 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61624, 1648, 886, '<td valign="top">I''m getting dizzy. But why did you leave the plant the way it should be?..</td>', 'I''m getting dizzy. But why did you leave the plant the way it should be?..', '2002-05-16 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61625, 1648, 1169, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2002-05-16 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61626, 1648, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  On first sight, this looks almost normal, just a cluttered shelf.  I like that you didn''t turn everything over.  For some reason thoug this photo looks as if it is not quite straight.  Would''ve also preferred if the plant wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'Great idea.  On first sight, this looks almost normal, just a cluttered shelf.  I like that you didn''t turn everything over.  For some reason thoug this photo looks as if it is not quite straight.  Would''ve also preferred if the plant wasn''t cut off.', '2002-05-16 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61627, 1648, 675, '<td valign="top">would have meant more if those things were hanging in place upside down</td>', 'would have meant more if those things were hanging in place upside down', '2002-05-17 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61628, 1648, 107, '<td valign="top">The plant should have been upside down as well.</td>', 'The plant should have been upside down as well.', '2002-05-17 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61629, 1648, 587, '<td valign="top">some of these things is not like the others....I would have taken the plant and bird out, too distracting and cancels out the ''upsidedown'' effect.</td>', 'some of these things is not like the others....I would have taken the plant and bird out, too distracting and cancels out the ''upsidedown'' effect.', '2002-05-17 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61630, 1648, 1191, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued, so you turned everything upside down, well I suppose that was the theme??</td>', 'I''m intrigued, so you turned everything upside down, well I suppose that was the theme??', '2002-05-17 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61631, 1648, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea -- very cool effect.</td>', 'Awesome idea -- very cool effect.', '2002-05-19 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61632, 1649, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  A little more light would have been nice... :)</td>', 'Nice shot!  A little more light would have been nice... :)', '2002-05-13 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61633, 1649, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I can''t see much of it. Seems dark. ?my monitor.<br/></td>', 'Interesting shot, but I can''t see much of it. Seems dark. ?my monitor.', '2002-05-13 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61634, 1649, 1024, '<td valign="top">This would have worked in the upright position better, the picture would have been rightside up and the letters on the sign upside down.</td>', 'This would have worked in the upright position better, the picture would have been rightside up and the letters on the sign upside down.', '2002-05-13 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61635, 1649, 1, '<td valign="top">Wait so they posted the sign upside down?  Nice find, but I think the image might be too dark.  More light on the sign would''ve helped.</td>', 'Wait so they posted the sign upside down?  Nice find, but I think the image might be too dark.  More light on the sign would''ve helped.', '2002-05-13 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61636, 1649, 1378, '<td valign="top">Creative....</td>', 'Creative....', '2002-05-13 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61637, 1649, 330, '<td valign="top">I like this picture more that most of the puther pictures that are just inverted. It has good composition and strong graphic qualities. But it is still just and upside down picture.</td>', 'I like this picture more that most of the puther pictures that are just inverted. It has good composition and strong graphic qualities. But it is still just and upside down picture.', '2002-05-13 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61638, 1649, 472, '<td valign="top">WOW. simultaneous events conspire to create a very very disorienting reality, full of perfect sillhouettes.  im impressed!</td>', 'WOW. simultaneous events conspire to create a very very disorienting reality, full of perfect sillhouettes.  im impressed!', '2002-05-13 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61639, 1649, 1599, '<td valign="top">GREAT GREAT GREAT    DID I SAY GREAT</td>', 'GREAT GREAT GREAT    DID I SAY GREAT', '2002-05-13 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61640, 1649, 1528, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!<br/>Too dark in my opinion, though.<br/>I do see that it brings out the lights, but reading the signs strains my eyes.</td>', 'Neat idea!Too dark in my opinion, though.I do see that it brings out the lights, but reading the signs strains my eyes.', '2002-05-13 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61641, 1649, 1031, '<td valign="top">Whichever way you take, use caution!</td>', 'Whichever way you take, use caution!', '2002-05-14 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61642, 1649, 862, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2002-05-14 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(61643, 1649, 139, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and I love the choice of the yellow light.   Every time I look, I expect "ONLY" to be upside down, before I remember that both the sign and the photo are upside down.   This is a really interesting photo to look at.</td>', 'Excellent idea, and I love the choice of the yellow light.   Every time I look, I expect "ONLY" to be upside down, before I remember that both the sign and the photo are upside down.   This is a really interesting photo to look at.', '2002-05-14 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61644, 1649, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very confusing!  Poor drivers!!!  Poor lightning, where''s the sun?    Photo 6 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 7</td>', 'Very confusing!  Poor drivers!!!  Poor lightning, where''s the sun?    Photo 6 Creativity 7 Upsidedown 8 total 7', '2002-05-14 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61645, 1649, 1529, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and I like the lights on yellow. Foreground is too dark. Try a fill flash or different time of day.</td>', 'Nice concept, and I like the lights on yellow. Foreground is too dark. Try a fill flash or different time of day.', '2002-05-14 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61646, 1649, 1143, '<td valign="top">What a great find (or did you have something to do with it?)   :o)  Either way, I scored it high because I think it''s fun and composed fairly well (although the railing along the top is a little distracting - you might try cropping the top a little). You also might try lightening it a little.</td>', 'What a great find (or did you have something to do with it?)   :o)  Either way, I scored it high because I think it''s fun and composed fairly well (although the railing along the top is a little distracting - you might try cropping the top a little). You also might try lightening it a little.', '2002-05-14 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61647, 1649, 1336, '<td valign="top">i like this photo.  it''s too bad it wasnt a clearer (or brighter) day</td>', 'i like this photo.  it''s too bad it wasnt a clearer (or brighter) day', '2002-05-15 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61648, 1649, 259, '<td valign="top">nice confusion</td>', 'nice confusion', '2002-05-16 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61649, 1649, 1135, '<td valign="top">I''m lost too.</td>', 'I''m lost too.', '2002-05-16 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61650, 1649, 886, '<td valign="top">Send it to your local transportation authority like this, upside down. We''d love to see their reply!!!</td>', 'Send it to your local transportation authority like this, upside down. We''d love to see their reply!!!', '2002-05-16 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61651, 1649, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really like the multiple traffic lights in the shot.  Like the other upside down roadsign, this seems really dark -- even if taken in the morning or evening, I think it needs to be a little brighter.  It may just be an optical illusion but the whole thing looks like it needs to be rotated the tiniest bit clockwise.  (Pure speculation -- wonder what it would look like with either green or red lights instead of yellow...)</td>', 'Really like the multiple traffic lights in the shot.  Like the other upside down roadsign, this seems really dark -- even if taken in the morning or evening, I think it needs to be a little brighter.  It may just be an optical illusion but the whole thing looks like it needs to be rotated the tiniest bit clockwise.  (Pure speculation -- wonder what it would look like with either green or red lights instead of yellow...)', '2002-05-17 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61652, 1649, 527, '<td valign="top">This is very funny and well done. I might have cropped that whole edge out at the top but I''m not sure. I really like it.</td>', 'This is very funny and well done. I might have cropped that whole edge out at the top but I''m not sure. I really like it.', '2002-05-19 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61653, 1650, 1344, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail it looked like a real car!  But then I zoomed in :)  If it were real this would win for sure -- hopefully you''ll be able to fool a lot of people!  Still getting high votes from me though..</td>', 'From the thumbnail it looked like a real car!  But then I zoomed in :)  If it were real this would win for sure -- hopefully you''ll be able to fool a lot of people!  Still getting high votes from me though..', '2002-05-13 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61654, 1650, 1360, '<td valign="top">It took quite a few views of this picture for me to realise what this really was, and what it wasnt...</td>', 'It took quite a few views of this picture for me to realise what this really was, and what it wasnt...', '2002-05-13 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61655, 1650, 1379, '<td valign="top">You caught great color in the sky... It really mirrors the shade of the car.</td>', 'You caught great color in the sky... It really mirrors the shade of the car.', '2002-05-13 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(61656, 1650, 1175, '<td valign="top">OHMIGOD THAT POOR BEETLE!!!!!  :~( Its a perfect photo for the challenge but technically not such a great photo due to the lighting and positioning.</td>', 'OHMIGOD THAT POOR BEETLE!!!!!  :~( Its a perfect photo for the challenge but technically not such a great photo due to the lighting and positioning.', '2002-05-13 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
