(61681, 1650, 107, '<td valign="top">I love the way you turned the car upside-down.  Makes for a humourous shot.. I also like the other car to the right, just slightly in the background, it proves there weren''t any obvious camera tricks envolved.  Did that scratch the paintwork?</td>', 'I love the way you turned the car upside-down.  Makes for a humourous shot.. I also like the other car to the right, just slightly in the background, it proves there weren''t any obvious camera tricks envolved.  Did that scratch the paintwork?', '2002-05-15 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
