(61689, 1650, 749, '<td valign="top">On first viewing, I thought this was a real car, but on subsequent I worked out that it was a toy - much like people are doing with my shot of the plane, its the grass that gives away the scale :o) Good lighting and imagination!</td>', 'On first viewing, I thought this was a real car, but on subsequent I worked out that it was a toy - much like people are doing with my shot of the plane, its the grass that gives away the scale :o) Good lighting and imagination!', '2002-05-18 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
