(61697, 1650, 714, '<td valign="top">I would just like to say thanks to all who commented on my photo.  I got some real good ones. <br/>That is all right chariot.  It was ment to fool ya.  It took about 30 shots of the beetle in different areas of my front yard and decided to go with this because of the van in the background.  I thought it would be a fun picture and didn''t think it would do so well, but I was wrong.  I have accompished my goal and got over 6.0.  Thanks again<br/>Sonja</td>', 'I would just like to say thanks to all who commented on my photo.  I got some real good ones. That is all right chariot.  It was ment to fool ya.  It took about 30 shots of the beetle in different areas of my front yard and decided to go with this because of the van in the background.  I thought it would be a fun picture and didn''t think it would do so well, but I was wrong.  I have accompished my goal and got over 6.0.  Thanks againSonja', '2002-05-20 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
